(548202, 55574, 12268, '<td valign="top">Holy cow, this is an insanely GREAT shot! Man, the focus, exposure, everything is SUPER fantastic! I''m blown away! So glad I was forced to sit this one out! I''d give you 10 10''s if I could. 10! I know it''s crazy early but this is the blue ribbon right here!</td>', 'Holy cow, this is an insanely GREAT shot! Man, the focus, exposure, everything is SUPER fantastic! I''m blown away! So glad I was forced to sit this one out! I''d give you 10 10''s if I could. 10! I know it''s crazy early but this is the blue ribbon right here!', '2004-01-19 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
