(548218, 55752, 6668, '<td valign="top">I love this cow...he''s got some wild hair! Did you comb it like that down over his eyes or is that how it is naturally?  Anyway great shot, only think I would have done differently is maybe clone the graw out of his hair to the right of his mouth since there were opening editing rules, Good luck!</td>', 'I love this cow...he''s got some wild hair! Did you comb it like that down over his eyes or is that how it is naturally?  Anyway great shot, only think I would have done differently is maybe clone the graw out of his hair to the right of his mouth since there were opening editing rules, Good luck!', '2004-01-19 00:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
