(548281, 55114, 6100, '<td valign="top">This might have been better if the hump and the rump weren''t cropped off. To me that leaves an uneven balance in the composition. I''m sure it''s not easy to be so near such a massive (and possibly dangerous) animal but see if, next time, you can keep the horizon level.</td>', 'This might have been better if the hump and the rump weren''t cropped off. To me that leaves an uneven balance in the composition. I''m sure it''s not easy to be so near such a massive (and possibly dangerous) animal but see if, next time, you can keep the horizon level.', '2004-01-19 00:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(548283, 55776, 14401, '<td valign="top">Nice image, a touch grainy looking foreground - don''t care for the border.</td>', 'Nice image, a touch grainy looking foreground - don''t care for the border.', '2004-01-19 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(548285, 55541, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- excellent job!  The clarity of the shot is impressive, and the steam is a real cool plus here.  I only wish you had submitted it at the full 640 pixels allowed.  That''s the only thing keeping me from giving it a 10.</td>', 'Wow -- excellent job!  The clarity of the shot is impressive, and the steam is a real cool plus here.  I only wish you had submitted it at the full 640 pixels allowed.  That''s the only thing keeping me from giving it a 10.', '2004-01-19 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
