(548550, 55707, 14453, '<td valign="top">I like your picture a lot. Good choice of subject, I like the closeup. Negative point: the dust on the black backbround is a bit disturbing.</td>', 'I like your picture a lot. Good choice of subject, I like the closeup. Negative point: the dust on the black backbround is a bit disturbing.', '2004-01-19 07:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
