(548971, 55777, 15805, '<td valign="top">I like the idea in this shot very much, actually it''s quite unique. The picture looks almost like a painting - heavy postprocessing perhaps? Would be even better without the car on the left. Congratulations on a nice shot!</td>', 'I like the idea in this shot very much, actually it''s quite unique. The picture looks almost like a painting - heavy postprocessing perhaps? Would be even better without the car on the left. Congratulations on a nice shot!', '2004-01-19 12:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
