(549254, 55821, 806, '<td valign="top">this is a photo of a tree with a nice backdrop. western skies are notorious for being large. the tree in the position it is in here lessens the impact of the ''great sky country''. colors and detail are wonderul, but the shot on the whole doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'this is a photo of a tree with a nice backdrop. western skies are notorious for being large. the tree in the position it is in here lessens the impact of the ''great sky country''. colors and detail are wonderul, but the shot on the whole doesn''t do much for me.', '2004-01-19 16:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(549256, 55818, 16318, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhh life!!!  What a great expression!!</td>', 'Ahhhhh life!!!  What a great expression!!', '2004-01-19 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(549257, 55496, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting angle to shoot these flowers, however, the quality suffers perhaps from over sharpening?... like the exposure .. the color of the petals does not get lost in the cloudy sky on the lower right.... they could almost be fireworks the way their petals burst out.</td>', 'interesting angle to shoot these flowers, however, the quality suffers perhaps from over sharpening?... like the exposure .. the color of the petals does not get lost in the cloudy sky on the lower right.... they could almost be fireworks the way their petals burst out.', '2004-01-19 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(549258, 55402, 16318, '<td valign="top">Having just left the "frozen" Northeast this photo gives me the CHILLS!!!  Cool (pardon the pun! ) shot!</td>', 'Having just left the "frozen" Northeast this photo gives me the CHILLS!!!  Cool (pardon the pun! ) shot!', '2004-01-19 16:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(549260, 55774, 806, '<td valign="top">cute photo of a child at play. I think it could be cropped down to take out the right half of the photo as the oof flower does not add to the story here.<br/>great focus on her eye. NG relevance? metsa.</td>', 'cute photo of a child at play. I think it could be cropped down to take out the right half of the photo as the oof flower does not add to the story here.great focus on her eye. NG relevance? metsa.', '2004-01-19 16:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(549261, 55814, 806, '<td valign="top">nice contrast between the white background and the darks and colors of the mask. it could almost be speaking. must be a beautiful piece. very NG, and has an average appeal.</td>', 'nice contrast between the white background and the darks and colors of the mask. it could almost be speaking. must be a beautiful piece. very NG, and has an average appeal.', '2004-01-19 16:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(549262, 55424, 16318, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to take a ride to see what''s around the bend. I might have cropped it a little different, to remove some of the sky;  I find that a bit distracting.</td>', 'Makes me want to take a ride to see what''s around the bend. I might have cropped it a little different, to remove some of the sky;  I find that a bit distracting.', '2004-01-19 16:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(549263, 55701, 16318, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!! : )</td>', 'Wow!!!! : )', '2004-01-19 16:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(549264, 55585, 806, '<td valign="top">nice colors and detail. sky seems over big. might crop the top up to the edge of the top most cloud on the right.</td>', 'nice colors and detail. sky seems over big. might crop the top up to the edge of the top most cloud on the right.', '2004-01-19 16:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
