(549266, 55809, 806, '<td valign="top">would like to see the entire edge of the mushroom in the dof, as that is the actual subject. could also be a bit brighter in the exposure.</td>', 'would like to see the entire edge of the mushroom in the dof, as that is the actual subject. could also be a bit brighter in the exposure.', '2004-01-19 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
