(549270, 55776, 806, '<td valign="top">wonderful sky and colors. nice exposure of the butte against the lighter sky.<br/>great textures in the foreground. could envision antelope or something running through the scene at any moment. this is an image that brings you there. nicely done.</td>', 'wonderful sky and colors. nice exposure of the butte against the lighter sky.great textures in the foreground. could envision antelope or something running through the scene at any moment. this is an image that brings you there. nicely done.', '2004-01-19 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
