(549273, 55717, 806, '<td valign="top">nice parrot (generic term, I know). lots of light and dark variation. .. can''t decide if that adds to this shot or not. :) NG relevant, but mediocre in attention grabbing.<br/></td>', 'nice parrot (generic term, I know). lots of light and dark variation. .. can''t decide if that adds to this shot or not. :) NG relevant, but mediocre in attention grabbing.', '2004-01-19 16:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
