(549301, 55724, 806, '<td valign="top">nostalgic shot. love the textures. is NG usually in vivid color? I am not judging on that because I don''t know.. but just a question.<br/></td>', 'nostalgic shot. love the textures. is NG usually in vivid color? I am not judging on that because I don''t know.. but just a question.', '2004-01-19 16:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(549302, 55152, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great bison shot, I like where you put him in the frame (may have liked him bigger relative to your background - it''s not as interesting as he is!)</td>', 'Great bison shot, I like where you put him in the frame (may have liked him bigger relative to your background - it''s not as interesting as he is!)', '2004-01-19 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(549303, 55729, 806, '<td valign="top">great shot! love the motion, the metropolis feel on such an ancient and historic area.</td>', 'great shot! love the motion, the metropolis feel on such an ancient and historic area.', '2004-01-19 16:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(549304, 55551, 14614, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the tilted pov.  I like the story you''re starting to tell with this shot.  THere''s a lot of elements that don''t add to the story (e.g. broken pillar in foreground, building, cars) that, if removed or blurred, would add to the main subject.  Too bad his face is in shadows.</td>', 'I don''t care for the tilted pov.  I like the story you''re starting to tell with this shot.  THere''s a lot of elements that don''t add to the story (e.g. broken pillar in foreground, building, cars) that, if removed or blurred, would add to the main subject.  Too bad his face is in shadows.', '2004-01-19 17:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(549305, 55669, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great title - you''ve almost written the story that goes with this fine picture, very NG.  Minor suggestion: tone down the hot blue in upper right.</td>', 'Great title - you''ve almost written the story that goes with this fine picture, very NG.  Minor suggestion: tone down the hot blue in upper right.', '2004-01-19 17:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(549306, 55717, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors on the bird.  Suggestion: spot darken the light branch in upper left along with upper right ones and throw some lightening on bird to have it stand out against lower right background.  Overall, well done. (editted comment - I now get the title!)</td>', 'Excellent colors on the bird.  Suggestion: spot darken the light branch in upper left along with upper right ones and throw some lightening on bird to have it stand out against lower right background.  Overall, well done. (editted comment - I now get the title!)', '2004-01-19 17:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(549308, 55483, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  Great NG colors, wonderful expression, picture tells a story.  Has it all! 10 - one of my picks for a ribbon</td>', 'Nice capture!  Great NG colors, wonderful expression, picture tells a story.  Has it all! 10 - one of my picks for a ribbon', '2004-01-19 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(549309, 55752, 14614, '<td valign="top">Yep, this in NG! Great hairy forehead and snout.  Nicely centered.  Dark in lower left is the only small negative.  Well done 10 - one of my picks for a ribbon</td>', 'Yep, this in NG! Great hairy forehead and snout.  Nicely centered.  Dark in lower left is the only small negative.  Well done 10 - one of my picks for a ribbon', '2004-01-19 17:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(549313, 55738, 806, '<td valign="top">very pretty. love the monochromatic colors. don''t like the hot spot on the top right.</td>', 'very pretty. love the monochromatic colors. don''t like the hot spot on the top right.', '2004-01-19 17:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(549316, 55781, 806, '<td valign="top">are they truly diminishing? how horrid!<br/>great colors.. really cold feeling with the blues.<br/>the rocks/pier the way they are framed in the shot causes a barrier to the eye that is trying to see the expanse of the lake.</td>', 'are they truly diminishing? how horrid!great colors.. really cold feeling with the blues.the rocks/pier the way they are framed in the shot causes a barrier to the eye that is trying to see the expanse of the lake.', '2004-01-19 17:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(549317, 55567, 6458, '<td valign="top">Wow. Cat shots don''t normally do it for me, but this is very good. Tons of mood and good light. Maybe a tad bit brighter would work better?   For a NG article - I''m not so sure, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. 9.</td>', 'Wow. Cat shots don''t normally do it for me, but this is very good. Tons of mood and good light. Maybe a tad bit brighter would work better?   For a NG article - I''m not so sure, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. 9.', '2004-01-19 17:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(549318, 55777, 806, '<td valign="top">nice documentary shot.... but did you apply some sort of effect to the image? like water color or something? Looks unnatural in the background. also, too tilted. needs to be rotated CW</td>', 'nice documentary shot.... but did you apply some sort of effect to the image? like water color or something? Looks unnatural in the background. also, too tilted. needs to be rotated CW', '2004-01-19 17:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
