(549342, 55507, 806, '<td valign="top">bravo! love the imagery/motion/story/documentation/lonliness/emotion.<br/>great capture! I could look at this a long time. more need to see this shot..</td>', 'bravo! love the imagery/motion/story/documentation/lonliness/emotion.great capture! I could look at this a long time. more need to see this shot..', '2004-01-19 17:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
