(549711, 55574, 11078, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!<br/>I went to the Zoo to try and take a photo of one of these beasties. only to arrive just after he had gone and hid in the bushes the guy next to me showed me his image on his digital camera.<br/>It wasent yours was it? I love it!</td>', 'Brilliant!I went to the Zoo to try and take a photo of one of these beasties. only to arrive just after he had gone and hid in the bushes the guy next to me showed me his image on his digital camera.It wasent yours was it? I love it!', '2004-01-19 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1);
