(549724, 55811, 1, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, though not so national geographic-ish.  You stood in the middle of the bridge to get a symmetrical shot, but the horizon isn''t so symmetrical.  It kind of throws you off a bit.  I wonder if standing to the right of left side would make it more balanced?</td>', 'Beautiful shot, though not so national geographic-ish.  You stood in the middle of the bridge to get a symmetrical shot, but the horizon isn''t so symmetrical.  It kind of throws you off a bit.  I wonder if standing to the right of left side would make it more balanced?', '2004-01-19 23:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(549725, 55717, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nice image and lighting</td>', 'Nice image and lighting', '2004-01-19 23:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(549727, 55536, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, you''ve captured her happiness (or so it seems).  The bottom of the image is slightly blurry or out of focus to me, perhaps a DOF adjustment would''ve fixed it.</td>', 'Cute shot, you''ve captured her happiness (or so it seems).  The bottom of the image is slightly blurry or out of focus to me, perhaps a DOF adjustment would''ve fixed it.', '2004-01-19 23:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(549729, 55790, 1, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best photographs I''ve seen on the site.  Such a contast between childhood and manhood (at least to me).  The softness is brilliant.  Unfortunately it doesn''t fit the challenge very well.  That''s all that''s keeping you from a 10.</td>', 'This is one of the best photographs I''ve seen on the site.  Such a contast between childhood and manhood (at least to me).  The softness is brilliant.  Unfortunately it doesn''t fit the challenge very well.  That''s all that''s keeping you from a 10.', '2004-01-19 23:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(549730, 55209, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the lighting is very intriguing, tho slightly dark.</td>', 'Great shot, the lighting is very intriguing, tho slightly dark.', '2004-01-19 23:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(549731, 55718, 1, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, though the subject isn''t the most interesting.  The coloring is very odd too.</td>', 'Fits the challenge, though the subject isn''t the most interesting.  The coloring is very odd too.', '2004-01-19 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
