(549742, 55507, 14156, '<td valign="top">Good picture but the passersby look like they could be multiple exposures of the same person. Perhaps a change of shoes would have worked better.</td>', 'Good picture but the passersby look like they could be multiple exposures of the same person. Perhaps a change of shoes would have worked better.', '2004-01-19 23:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
