(549997, 55738, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well composed and great colour, I am a lover of simplicity in pics and this is a good example of it working well. Personally, I would have preferred the picture without the bright corner and just the gentle graded shades from right to left.<br/>but that`s only my opinion.<br/>Well done &amp; good luck with it.</td>', 'Well composed and great colour, I am a lover of simplicity in pics and this is a good example of it working well. Personally, I would have preferred the picture without the bright corner and just the gentle graded shades from right to left.but that`s only my opinion.Well done & good luck with it.', '2004-01-20 07:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
