(550423, 55640, 7291, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the detail.  It looks like it''s pretty heavily sharpened but it works very well here. - 9</td>', 'Great job capturing the detail.  It looks like it''s pretty heavily sharpened but it works very well here. - 9', '2004-01-20 12:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(550428, 55694, 7291, '<td valign="top">What strange lighting.  The sun is obviously still in the sky but the snow makes it appear as if there is lighting coming from the right also.  Very Nice!</td>', 'What strange lighting.  The sun is obviously still in the sky but the snow makes it appear as if there is lighting coming from the right also.  Very Nice!', '2004-01-20 12:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(550451, 55541, 12962, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  It is similar to a NG recent cover (how great is that?!!!).  I wish you submitted a larger photograph so your readers can see more details.  At this size, I can see the clarity of your shot but it would even be more awesome at a larger size.  The blurred background is excellent because it makes your subject stand out more.  Congratulations and I hope you do well.</td>', 'Great capture.  It is similar to a NG recent cover (how great is that?!!!).  I wish you submitted a larger photograph so your readers can see more details.  At this size, I can see the clarity of your shot but it would even be more awesome at a larger size.  The blurred background is excellent because it makes your subject stand out more.  Congratulations and I hope you do well.', '2004-01-20 12:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(550452, 55536, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice, appropriate folk subject.  I especially like that you included the walls with the decoration - the walls add more to the tradition that you wanted to convey.  The photograph overall is a little bit overexposed so maybe a little bit of saturation added in post processing wouldn''t hurt.</td>', 'Nice, appropriate folk subject.  I especially like that you included the walls with the decoration - the walls add more to the tradition that you wanted to convey.  The photograph overall is a little bit overexposed so maybe a little bit of saturation added in post processing wouldn''t hurt.', '2004-01-20 12:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(550456, 55471, 12962, '<td valign="top">My favorite shot in the world.  I can\''t get enough of this so I will be biased.  First of all, you were so brave to stand the freeze when you took this :-).  Second (beyond your control), I wish they allow panoramic sizes because this one would be so great in panorama.  Third, so much details at his resolution ... I could even see my office, well, almost.  I also like the color - dark background and foreground - so the building lights would stand out more.    Good job!!!</td>', 'My favorite shot in the world.  I can\''t get enough of this so I will be biased.  First of all, you were so brave to stand the freeze when you took this :-).  Second (beyond your control), I wish they allow panoramic sizes because this one would be so great in panorama.  Third, so much details at his resolution ... I could even see my office, well, almost.  I also like the color - dark background and foreground - so the building lights would stand out more.    Good job!!!', '2004-01-20 13:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(550457, 55779, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice.  There was actually a feature on flamingoes in NG 30 years ago with a similar picture ... so you are in the right track.  I wish for a more vivid coloration though ... so perhaps added saturation (?) might enhance this already excellent picture.</td>', 'Nice.  There was actually a feature on flamingoes in NG 30 years ago with a similar picture ... so you are in the right track.  I wish for a more vivid coloration though ... so perhaps added saturation (?) might enhance this already excellent picture.', '2004-01-20 13:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(550458, 55507, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate title for this action shot.  Your composition is quite powerful ...</td>', 'Very appropriate title for this action shot.  Your composition is quite powerful ...', '2004-01-20 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(550472, 55507, 14035, '<td valign="top">I am very impressed with this photograph. The clarity of the sitting man against the motion of the moving people is very compelling. I see the subject as "left behind" and can certainly see it tying into some form of NG scenario. Technically, the only thing I can see is that the background may be a tad too white, a tad too contrasted, but I believe that is a matter of personal taste. One of my highest scores this challenge.</td>', 'I am very impressed with this photograph. The clarity of the sitting man against the motion of the moving people is very compelling. I see the subject as "left behind" and can certainly see it tying into some form of NG scenario. Technically, the only thing I can see is that the background may be a tad too white, a tad too contrasted, but I believe that is a matter of personal taste. One of my highest scores this challenge.', '2004-01-20 13:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(550476, 55744, 14035, '<td valign="top">Bravo! You''ve captured the spirit of NG precisely, imo. It''s a wee bit unfocused but in some way that seems to add to the ambience. Excellent entry.</td>', 'Bravo! You''ve captured the spirit of NG precisely, imo. It''s a wee bit unfocused but in some way that seems to add to the ambience. Excellent entry.', '2004-01-20 13:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(550478, 55395, 5508, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s an eagle.</td>', 'Oh that''s an eagle.', '2004-01-20 13:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(550481, 55769, 14035, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. Those odd perspective shots are hard to frame - I see you chose a right alignment to the scaffolding - good choice, I think. Perhaps you might have  cropped the entire left vertical line and the persoective skew would not have been noticeable. The blue and cream tones are sublime. I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'Pretty shot. Those odd perspective shots are hard to frame - I see you chose a right alignment to the scaffolding - good choice, I think. Perhaps you might have  cropped the entire left vertical line and the persoective skew would not have been noticeable. The blue and cream tones are sublime. I like this shot a lot.', '2004-01-20 13:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(550482, 55811, 14035, '<td valign="top">What a beauty. Your composition is sublime.  The weather looks cold - too cold to be so deeply colored - did you have to push the saturation a lot? I admire your eye.</td>', 'What a beauty. Your composition is sublime.  The weather looks cold - too cold to be so deeply colored - did you have to push the saturation a lot? I admire your eye.', '2004-01-20 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
