(551452, 55695, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - challenge met, good tones, could have used a touch more depth to the texture, but I think that comes from this being low resolution - or from too tight a crop, perhaps. One thing - it''s ''Roman'', rather than ''Romanic'', but that doesn''t cost you points.</td>', 'Nice shot - challenge met, good tones, could have used a touch more depth to the texture, but I think that comes from this being low resolution - or from too tight a crop, perhaps. One thing - it''s ''Roman'', rather than ''Romanic'', but that doesn''t cost you points.', '2004-01-21 05:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(551459, 55729, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s something I actively don''t like about this - but I don''t know what it is. It''s rather busy, but I don''t think its that; the skyline is a bit random, and undefined against the sky, but not that. There are three points that pull the eye, for me: the bright street-light, the moving boat, and the brighter building picture right, and I think that gives a cluttered feeling ot it, and no real sense of subject.</td>', 'There''s something I actively don''t like about this - but I don''t know what it is. It''s rather busy, but I don''t think its that; the skyline is a bit random, and undefined against the sky, but not that. There are three points that pull the eye, for me: the bright street-light, the moving boat, and the brighter building picture right, and I think that gives a cluttered feeling ot it, and no real sense of subject.', '2004-01-21 05:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(551587, 55718, 7263, '<td valign="top">as I ahve said on all the other artifact shots, a bit more thought with the background would do wonders - perhaps an old stone wall or something wooden?</td>', 'as I ahve said on all the other artifact shots, a bit more thought with the background would do wonders - perhaps an old stone wall or something wooden?', '2004-01-21 07:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
