(551628, 55242, 7263, '<td valign="top">Bugger. Always someone who is a clear winner. Well done and congrats on your forthcoming ribbon ;)<br/> <br/>Usualy wish good luck on images I rate 10, but don''t really think you''ll need it. <br/> <br/>Super coloring, and great DOF. Too many people neglect the BG, including fences, white card, people etc but this is perfect with more pink birds. Great stuff.<br/>10+</td>', 'Bugger. Always someone who is a clear winner. Well done and congrats on your forthcoming ribbon ;) Usualy wish good luck on images I rate 10, but don''t really think you''ll need it.  Super coloring, and great DOF. Too many people neglect the BG, including fences, white card, people etc but this is perfect with more pink birds. Great stuff.10+', '2004-01-21 07:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(551676, 55587, 13158, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!!!  You captured the primal instinct of this animal well.  Hope there was a fence between you and this gorgeous creature!  Sorry, can''t vote on the member challenges, but wanted to wish you luck, I love this!</td>', 'Fantastic!!!  You captured the primal instinct of this animal well.  Hope there was a fence between you and this gorgeous creature!  Sorry, can''t vote on the member challenges, but wanted to wish you luck, I love this!', '2004-01-21 08:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(551765, 55522, 5112, '<td valign="top">I guess we know whose picture this is now :)  Congratulations on your win at DPContest, I loved it there, it''s a beautiful picture, and I hope you do well here also.  10 from me.</td>', 'I guess we know whose picture this is now :)  Congratulations on your win at DPContest, I loved it there, it''s a beautiful picture, and I hope you do well here also.  10 from me.', '2004-01-21 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(551783, 55541, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. I like the backlighting of the head and the breath. I recently got a promo from NG and it had a section on bald eagles. This shot could have easily been one of them. 10.</td>', 'Excellent image. I like the backlighting of the head and the breath. I recently got a promo from NG and it had a section on bald eagles. This shot could have easily been one of them. 10.', '2004-01-21 09:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(551789, 55819, 6100, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but I think this would have been better if it weren''t so tightly cropped and if we could see more of the body of the animal. Sometimes it''s good to fill the frame, but this time, I don''t think it works as well. Generally, the exposure is good and I like the attentiveness of the animal. 8</td>', 'Just my opinion, but I think this would have been better if it weren''t so tightly cropped and if we could see more of the body of the animal. Sometimes it''s good to fill the frame, but this time, I don''t think it works as well. Generally, the exposure is good and I like the attentiveness of the animal. 8', '2004-01-21 09:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(551800, 55471, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a nice cityscape shot, but I think moving in a little would help it out looking at it at this resolution.  The toning of this shot could be a little warmer too.  I know its cold there, but it has a little extra cold feeling without much color.</td>', 'This is a nice cityscape shot, but I think moving in a little would help it out looking at it at this resolution.  The toning of this shot could be a little warmer too.  I know its cold there, but it has a little extra cold feeling without much color.', '2004-01-21 09:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(551808, 55499, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I like the sky colors but am a little disappointed that the foreground details were discarded at their expense.  It is a nice shot still, just looks like you could''ve used a neutral density filter to darken the sky and but keep more of the foreground details.  The sand patterns if more visible would really add some life to the bottom of this photo.</td>', 'Great colors.  I like the sky colors but am a little disappointed that the foreground details were discarded at their expense.  It is a nice shot still, just looks like you could''ve used a neutral density filter to darken the sky and but keep more of the foreground details.  The sand patterns if more visible would really add some life to the bottom of this photo.', '2004-01-21 09:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(551818, 55769, 3540, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The one thing I''d like to see different, and this is getting a little picky, is having the guys on both sides of the frame.  I think it would be a little more balanced of a picture.  This is really good the way it is, but in my eyes, it''s what makes the 9 become a 10.  Nice work at any rate.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The one thing I''d like to see different, and this is getting a little picky, is having the guys on both sides of the frame.  I think it would be a little more balanced of a picture.  This is really good the way it is, but in my eyes, it''s what makes the 9 become a 10.  Nice work at any rate.', '2004-01-21 09:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(551829, 55541, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is good.  Its a little bit small, but good.  Good color and excellent exposure.  The steam (I think its steam) in the background is a good touch.</td>', 'This is good.  Its a little bit small, but good.  Good color and excellent exposure.  The steam (I think its steam) in the background is a good touch.', '2004-01-21 10:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(551830, 55707, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well taken with good colors and details.  I think this looks like a good shot for this challenge.  Nice job 7</td>', 'Well taken with good colors and details.  I think this looks like a good shot for this challenge.  Nice job 7', '2004-01-21 10:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(551832, 55541, 215, '<td valign="top">Exceptional capture. Good depth of field. Sharp. Might be better to crop the right side off or have more of the eagle?</td>', 'Exceptional capture. Good depth of field. Sharp. Might be better to crop the right side off or have more of the eagle?', '2004-01-21 10:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(551834, 55756, 215, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Not sure if opening the shadows would have helped, but that''s one thing I would try if it were my photo.</td>', 'Excellent. Not sure if opening the shadows would have helped, but that''s one thing I would try if it were my photo.', '2004-01-21 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(551862, 55815, 3540, '<td valign="top">Exceptional composition on this one.  My only liitle minor beef on this one is that it looks just a little oversharpened.  I''m curious to know if you could''ve gotten a greater depth of field on this one.  You''ll have to take a 9 on this one.  This is a remarkable photo.</td>', 'Exceptional composition on this one.  My only liitle minor beef on this one is that it looks just a little oversharpened.  I''m curious to know if you could''ve gotten a greater depth of field on this one.  You''ll have to take a 9 on this one.  This is a remarkable photo.', '2004-01-21 10:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(551871, 55680, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  Unfortunately it looks like the camera couldn''t properly handle the color or its been overprocessed.  The sky has lots of problems.  The guy at the bottom should''ve been posed a little different.  Something to show his arms a little more.  No offense, but he looks like he has no arms nor a neck.  The idea is really good, I think you just need to perfect the details a bit.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  Unfortunately it looks like the camera couldn''t properly handle the color or its been overprocessed.  The sky has lots of problems.  The guy at the bottom should''ve been posed a little different.  Something to show his arms a little more.  No offense, but he looks like he has no arms nor a neck.  The idea is really good, I think you just need to perfect the details a bit.', '2004-01-21 10:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(551883, 55812, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, peaceful scene, but I think it would be far more effective cropped to a panoramic. I think a crop just above the yellow in the sky would be one way to go, or elimination of most of the water another way.</td>', 'This is a nice, peaceful scene, but I think it would be far more effective cropped to a panoramic. I think a crop just above the yellow in the sky would be one way to go, or elimination of most of the water another way.', '2004-01-21 10:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(551888, 55360, 12733, '<td valign="top">The yellow border certainly captures the spirit of National Geographic. This is a very sharp shot of the bird, with a simple background. Looks great.</td>', 'The yellow border certainly captures the spirit of National Geographic. This is a very sharp shot of the bird, with a simple background. Looks great.', '2004-01-21 10:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(551889, 55499, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in the sky; I think there''s too much dark foreground.</td>', 'I like the colors in the sky; I think there''s too much dark foreground.', '2004-01-21 10:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(551893, 55420, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly sharp, and the cat''s expression gives the feeling that he''s about to jump right off the screen at you.</td>', 'Brilliantly sharp, and the cat''s expression gives the feeling that he''s about to jump right off the screen at you.', '2004-01-21 10:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(551896, 55560, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflections of brilliant colors in the sky.</td>', 'Very nice reflections of brilliant colors in the sky.', '2004-01-21 10:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(551900, 55725, 12733, '<td valign="top">The statue is sharp and clear. The out-of-focus and too bright piece behind it is distracting.</td>', 'The statue is sharp and clear. The out-of-focus and too bright piece behind it is distracting.', '2004-01-21 10:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(551905, 55564, 12733, '<td valign="top">The soft, fluffy texture of the penguin contrasts nicely with the rough look of the ice. Both are rendered well enough to make that contrast clear.</td>', 'The soft, fluffy texture of the penguin contrasts nicely with the rough look of the ice. Both are rendered well enough to make that contrast clear.', '2004-01-21 10:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(551907, 55820, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a nice choice of statue, and the soft lighting and relatively plain background help to make the photo more than just a record of the sculptor''s work.</td>', 'This is a nice choice of statue, and the soft lighting and relatively plain background help to make the photo more than just a record of the sculptor''s work.', '2004-01-21 10:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(551909, 55807, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the fine shapes of the branches against the sky and the clean, unbroken snow. The sun in the center seems overbright.</td>', 'I like the fine shapes of the branches against the sky and the clean, unbroken snow. The sun in the center seems overbright.', '2004-01-21 10:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(551912, 55507, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and execution. Was this a slow shutter or post-processing to get the blurry effect?</td>', 'Interesting concept and execution. Was this a slow shutter or post-processing to get the blurry effect?', '2004-01-21 10:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(551914, 55669, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of the cactus - clean and well defined. I''m really turned off by that strip of bright blue at the right, it gives the picture a very unnatural look that is out of keeping with the message.</td>', 'Very nice shot of the cactus - clean and well defined. I''m really turned off by that strip of bright blue at the right, it gives the picture a very unnatural look that is out of keeping with the message.', '2004-01-21 10:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(551917, 55789, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the mask. If this were a real magazine, it would leave space for some text above it. The yellow border is very reminiscent of the National Geographic style.</td>', 'Nice placement of the mask. If this were a real magazine, it would leave space for some text above it. The yellow border is very reminiscent of the National Geographic style.', '2004-01-21 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(551919, 55614, 12733, '<td valign="top">These trees must struggle to survive on this steep hillside, and you have captured that feeling well.</td>', 'These trees must struggle to survive on this steep hillside, and you have captured that feeling well.', '2004-01-21 10:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(551922, 55767, 12733, '<td valign="top">The picture is sharp and clear, and the two men talking while the others stare straight ahead gives a nice, personal touch to the scene.</td>', 'The picture is sharp and clear, and the two men talking while the others stare straight ahead gives a nice, personal touch to the scene.', '2004-01-21 11:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(551926, 55680, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the sky colors, the sun''s disk and the silhouetted bird. I''m kind of ambivalent about the silhouetted person on the shore.</td>', 'I really like the sky colors, the sun''s disk and the silhouetted bird. I''m kind of ambivalent about the silhouetted person on the shore.', '2004-01-21 11:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(551929, 55782, 12733, '<td valign="top">The colors are brilliant, and the tree seems to stand out from the others, as it should.</td>', 'The colors are brilliant, and the tree seems to stand out from the others, as it should.', '2004-01-21 11:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(551931, 55718, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and muted colors. Your lighting is very nice also.</td>', 'I like the textures and muted colors. Your lighting is very nice also.', '2004-01-21 11:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(551937, 55809, 12733, '<td valign="top">The mushroom stands out brilliantly against the darker background. Very nice composition, lighting and colors.</td>', 'The mushroom stands out brilliantly against the darker background. Very nice composition, lighting and colors.', '2004-01-21 11:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(551939, 55747, 12733, '<td valign="top">That is a great expression on the ape. It seems very pleased with its snack. Nice lighting and tight crop.</td>', 'That is a great expression on the ape. It seems very pleased with its snack. Nice lighting and tight crop.', '2004-01-21 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(551941, 55774, 12733, '<td valign="top">The girl is cute, the colors are pretty, but that out-of-focus, very light flowr in the front dilutes the effect.</td>', 'The girl is cute, the colors are pretty, but that out-of-focus, very light flowr in the front dilutes the effect.', '2004-01-21 11:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(551945, 55769, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the iron work and detailing of the building, and the workers provide a human element that adds a lot.</td>', 'I really like the iron work and detailing of the building, and the workers provide a human element that adds a lot.', '2004-01-21 11:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(551948, 55822, 12733, '<td valign="top">That soft, foggy effect gives this photo a very peaceful mood. The soft pastel colors are beautiful.</td>', 'That soft, foggy effect gives this photo a very peaceful mood. The soft pastel colors are beautiful.', '2004-01-21 11:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(551951, 55695, 12733, '<td valign="top">These are beautiful coloumns, and your point of view brings out the best in them.</td>', 'These are beautiful coloumns, and your point of view brings out the best in them.', '2004-01-21 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(551953, 55587, 12733, '<td valign="top">Feeding time at the zoo, or a tiger in the wild? Either way, you''ve captured a powerful expression. This is no cute kitty or tamed beast.</td>', 'Feeding time at the zoo, or a tiger in the wild? Either way, you''ve captured a powerful expression. This is no cute kitty or tamed beast.', '2004-01-21 11:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(551955, 55574, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant DOF to get most of the tiger sharp and clear. He looks very philisophical for a wild animal.</td>', 'Brilliant DOF to get most of the tiger sharp and clear. He looks very philisophical for a wild animal.', '2004-01-21 11:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(551958, 55694, 3540, '<td valign="top">great find and capture.  Great shot.  My first 10 of the challenge.  I love the contrast with the dark sky</td>', 'great find and capture.  Great shot.  My first 10 of the challenge.  I love the contrast with the dark sky', '2004-01-21 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(551959, 55811, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and nicely muted colors.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and nicely muted colors.', '2004-01-21 11:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(551963, 55316, 12733, '<td valign="top">The swans are nicely rendered, but I think the foreground reflections, while interestring, are also distracting. The swans are the picture, and they should be emphasized through tighter cropping, IMHO.</td>', 'The swans are nicely rendered, but I think the foreground reflections, while interestring, are also distracting. The swans are the picture, and they should be emphasized through tighter cropping, IMHO.', '2004-01-21 11:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(551966, 55564, 3540, '<td valign="top">Its too underexposed.  This kind of has a dark artsy feel to it, which I like.  I don''t feel that''s a good quality in the photojournalistic world of magazines like NG.  It''s a little too much like a mug shot.</td>', 'Its too underexposed.  This kind of has a dark artsy feel to it, which I like.  I don''t feel that''s a good quality in the photojournalistic world of magazines like NG.  It''s a little too much like a mug shot.', '2004-01-21 11:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(551969, 55734, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty photo with great detail on the swans. It also conveys an emotional message that adds to the quality.</td>', 'This is a very pretty photo with great detail on the swans. It also conveys an emotional message that adds to the quality.', '2004-01-21 11:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(551975, 55230, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of blur to emphasize the motion, and a very sharp rendition of the vehicle and the rider. Your title also makes a valid point.</td>', 'Nice use of blur to emphasize the motion, and a very sharp rendition of the vehicle and the rider. Your title also makes a valid point.', '2004-01-21 11:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(551982, 55815, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a great closeup. The frost looks like jewels on the web. I would have liked to see the portion at the right and back sharper, but that''s a bit picky. Nice shot.</td>', 'What a great closeup. The frost looks like jewels on the web. I would have liked to see the portion at the right and back sharper, but that''s a bit picky. Nice shot.', '2004-01-21 11:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(551987, 55790, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion. I like the lighting that appears to be coming through an open door.</td>', 'Nice compostion. I like the lighting that appears to be coming through an open door.', '2004-01-21 11:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(551993, 55114, 2843, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but its poorly composed and without much contrast or color. Of course I''d be afraid to get close enough to even take a shot :)</td>', 'Great subject, but its poorly composed and without much contrast or color. Of course I''d be afraid to get close enough to even take a shot :)', '2004-01-21 11:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(551999, 55696, 2843, '<td valign="top">Nice and dynamic, very fitting for challenge. Could be composed better and needs more contrast.</td>', 'Nice and dynamic, very fitting for challenge. Could be composed better and needs more contrast.', '2004-01-21 11:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(552002, 55614, 2843, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but the angle is a bit abstract for National Geographic.</td>', 'Interesting shot but the angle is a bit abstract for National Geographic.', '2004-01-21 11:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(552005, 55705, 2843, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge but needs more contrast, less hotness on the water, and man I am sick of seagull photos :) Seriously though, a nice shot.</td>', 'Fits challenge but needs more contrast, less hotness on the water, and man I am sick of seagull photos :) Seriously though, a nice shot.', '2004-01-21 11:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(552107, 55758, 11895, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors; there are many verticle lines which could have been used to guide in rotating this to level, then perhaps crop the palm tree from the left</td>', 'beautiful colors; there are many verticle lines which could have been used to guide in rotating this to level, then perhaps crop the palm tree from the left', '2004-01-21 11:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552135, 55812, 3540, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a bad backdrop for something, but it seems a bit subjectless to me.</td>', 'This isn''t a bad backdrop for something, but it seems a bit subjectless to me.', '2004-01-21 12:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(552141, 55729, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I wish the boat on the left of the frame was still or not there.  Exposure is almost perfect except for that obnoxious light right in the middle.  Nice work 8</td>', 'Great shot.  I wish the boat on the left of the frame was still or not there.  Exposure is almost perfect except for that obnoxious light right in the middle.  Nice work 8', '2004-01-21 12:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(552143, 55218, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. You did very well, getting all the texture that you could with this much of a spread from light to dark. There is something about the foreground that throws off the composition. I think it''s the darkness. Pretty, none the less.</td>', 'Nice shot. You did very well, getting all the texture that you could with this much of a spread from light to dark. There is something about the foreground that throws off the composition. I think it''s the darkness. Pretty, none the less.', '2004-01-21 12:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(552149, 55771, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good color.  Nice crisp shot.  I don''t really like the framing of the shot so much.  I think you could''ve shown a little more of him.</td>', 'Good color.  Nice crisp shot.  I don''t really like the framing of the shot so much.  I think you could''ve shown a little more of him.', '2004-01-21 12:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(552159, 55541, 15648, '<td valign="top">AWESOME SHOT!! love the detail.</td>', 'AWESOME SHOT!! love the detail.', '2004-01-21 12:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(552163, 55316, 3540, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animals.  The picture is pretty well taken.  I''m really lost though as to why this is framed this way.  the negative space at the bottom is not leading me to the swans, but instead it leads me to "comment on this photograph" which is not conducive to this photo, especially since the upper part is really nice.  Maybe you have succeeded in making me comment on this photo, but a stunning picture would''ve done the same thing :)</td>', 'Beautiful animals.  The picture is pretty well taken.  I''m really lost though as to why this is framed this way.  the negative space at the bottom is not leading me to the swans, but instead it leads me to "comment on this photograph" which is not conducive to this photo, especially since the upper part is really nice.  Maybe you have succeeded in making me comment on this photo, but a stunning picture would''ve done the same thing :)', '2004-01-21 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(552166, 55701, 15648, '<td valign="top">Any chance on you rotating this slightly. Love the colors</td>', 'Any chance on you rotating this slightly. Love the colors', '2004-01-21 12:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(552167, 55507, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m tempted to ask if this is the same man/dog that was posted in the forums a while ago. But that doesn''t matter. I love how the people motion really isolates your subjects to reinforce your title. The length of the line of people  makes me think of time also, like how long will people ignore the homeless. This is just a wonderful journalistic image. Hope you are paying him for his help.</td>', 'I''m tempted to ask if this is the same man/dog that was posted in the forums a while ago. But that doesn''t matter. I love how the people motion really isolates your subjects to reinforce your title. The length of the line of people  makes me think of time also, like how long will people ignore the homeless. This is just a wonderful journalistic image. Hope you are paying him for his help.', '2004-01-21 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(552169, 55242, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a NG caliber photo.  Stunning really.  Excellent color, exposed to perfection.  I barely noticed that you cut off a little of the neck.  It matters little to me though.  Nice job 8</td>', 'This is a NG caliber photo.  Stunning really.  Excellent color, exposed to perfection.  I barely noticed that you cut off a little of the neck.  It matters little to me though.  Nice job 8', '2004-01-21 12:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(552172, 55694, 15648, '<td valign="top">i''d love to see this as a B/W<br/>Nice job</td>', 'i''d love to see this as a B/WNice job', '2004-01-21 12:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(552176, 55757, 15648, '<td valign="top">Excellent Composition. Nice job<br/>Border??????? Questionable.</td>', 'Excellent Composition. Nice jobBorder??????? Questionable.', '2004-01-21 12:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(552183, 55499, 15648, '<td valign="top">Beautifel Colours. Great Shot!!!!</td>', 'Beautifel Colours. Great Shot!!!!', '2004-01-21 12:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(552185, 55242, 15648, '<td valign="top">My mother would LOVE this photo. nice Job</td>', 'My mother would LOVE this photo. nice Job', '2004-01-21 12:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(552187, 55747, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. The shadows help show this Old Man''s Age!!<br/>Nice Shot!!</td>', 'Great Shot. The shadows help show this Old Man''s Age!!Nice Shot!!', '2004-01-21 12:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(552189, 55813, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The blue ceiling and muted pallette gives this one a calming feeling. And I feel it does fit the challenge, maybe an article about airports around the world. The only thing I feel that could be improved is the composition. It''s hard to tell exactly what the center of interest should be.<br/>Are you having problems resizing your pictures? If you post a question in the forums, no matter what program you use, someone will help you out with information on how to do it properly. The only reason I say this is because it looks like you took this with a camera that is capable of producing much larger pictures without degrading the quality. I will try to come back later and delete this part so it doesn''t show after the contest is over.</td>', 'Nice picture.  The blue ceiling and muted pallette gives this one a calming feeling. And I feel it does fit the challenge, maybe an article about airports around the world. The only thing I feel that could be improved is the composition. It''s hard to tell exactly what the center of interest should be.Are you having problems resizing your pictures? If you post a question in the forums, no matter what program you use, someone will help you out with information on how to do it properly. The only reason I say this is because it looks like you took this with a camera that is capable of producing much larger pictures without degrading the quality. I will try to come back later and delete this part so it doesn''t show after the contest is over.', '2004-01-21 12:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(552191, 55811, 15648, '<td valign="top">This would look great if you cloned out shadow on wooden path</td>', 'This would look great if you cloned out shadow on wooden path', '2004-01-21 12:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(552192, 55790, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo has a great mood.  It has a really warm look to it in a timeless kind of way.  It easily could''ve been greyscaled and I personally would''ve done that to make it look more vintage, but I''d have made a huge mistake because that''s what I do... You did the right thing here.  Excellent image 9</td>', 'This photo has a great mood.  It has a really warm look to it in a timeless kind of way.  It easily could''ve been greyscaled and I personally would''ve done that to make it look more vintage, but I''d have made a huge mistake because that''s what I do... You did the right thing here.  Excellent image 9', '2004-01-21 12:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(552205, 55522, 11800, '<td valign="top">Colors, composition exposure, beautiful. And you even got the snow motion. Great job.</td>', 'Colors, composition exposure, beautiful. And you even got the snow motion. Great job.', '2004-01-21 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(552207, 55807, 15648, '<td valign="top">SWEET!!!!!!</td>', 'SWEET!!!!!!', '2004-01-21 12:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(552209, 55123, 15648, '<td valign="top">Bee seems to be BLURRY</td>', 'Bee seems to be BLURRY', '2004-01-21 12:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(552210, 55574, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Good detail and nicely "posed" by the kitty.  The details in the face are just stunning.  Nice work 9</td>', 'Excellent photo. Good detail and nicely "posed" by the kitty.  The details in the face are just stunning.  Nice work 9', '2004-01-21 12:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(552217, 55790, 15648, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Nice suttle effect. Soft Focus???</td>', 'I like this shot. Nice suttle effect. Soft Focus???', '2004-01-21 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(552220, 55640, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice. And real live rock. I think I would have liked to see an amemone with these guys, but I guess you had to take whatever was there. Is this your''s or a public aquarium?</td>', 'Nice. And real live rock. I think I would have liked to see an amemone with these guys, but I guess you had to take whatever was there. Is this your''s or a public aquarium?', '2004-01-21 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(552239, 55230, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good panning technique.  Not so sure it''d be a national geographic type shot, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  Might be just a little bit underexposed but understandably so due to the motion.</td>', 'Good panning technique.  Not so sure it''d be a national geographic type shot, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.  Might be just a little bit underexposed but understandably so due to the motion.', '2004-01-21 12:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(552260, 55744, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice photojournalistic picture. I like the looks each of the children have.  The tones are good as well as the exposure. The composition could have been moved over a little to the right. The compression artifacts  detracts a bit from the power of the picture.</td>', 'Nice photojournalistic picture. I like the looks each of the children have.  The tones are good as well as the exposure. The composition could have been moved over a little to the right. The compression artifacts  detracts a bit from the power of the picture.', '2004-01-21 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(552272, 55757, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of this one. The green adds a nice touch to the picture without drawing the eyes away from the focus on the monkey. True ng colors, nice and bright and a bit oversaturated. This is worthy of the cover, so the border doesn''t detract.</td>', 'I like the depth of this one. The green adds a nice touch to the picture without drawing the eyes away from the focus on the monkey. True ng colors, nice and bright and a bit oversaturated. This is worthy of the cover, so the border doesn''t detract.', '2004-01-21 12:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(552282, 55643, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good composition, even the branches add to the flow of the shot. It looks a bit washed out on my monitor. Maybe if you increased the saturation and contrast. But, it could be my monitor, although, compared with other pictures in this challenge that doesn''t seem to be the problem.</td>', 'Good composition, even the branches add to the flow of the shot. It looks a bit washed out on my monitor. Maybe if you increased the saturation and contrast. But, it could be my monitor, although, compared with other pictures in this challenge that doesn''t seem to be the problem.', '2004-01-21 13:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(552298, 55242, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color. It looks a little soft, and the neck is cut off. The color is almost good enough to carry this to the winners circle.</td>', 'Beautiful color. It looks a little soft, and the neck is cut off. The color is almost good enough to carry this to the winners circle.', '2004-01-21 13:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(552309, 55501, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed with a wide range of interesting subjects. It looks a bit hazy and it might have been improved by using a uv or polorizer. The reason I suggest it is because I want to see the castle(?) more clearly. If you did use one of these, please ignore my comment.</td>', 'Beautifully composed with a wide range of interesting subjects. It looks a bit hazy and it might have been improved by using a uv or polorizer. The reason I suggest it is because I want to see the castle(?) more clearly. If you did use one of these, please ignore my comment.', '2004-01-21 13:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(552334, 55629, 11800, '<td valign="top">A good human interest shot. Good composition and colors. It seems odd that you didn''t ask them to turn towards you, like they were protecting their property or greeting you. A pretty picture anyway.</td>', 'A good human interest shot. Good composition and colors. It seems odd that you didn''t ask them to turn towards you, like they were protecting their property or greeting you. A pretty picture anyway.', '2004-01-21 13:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(552341, 55399, 7628, '<td valign="top">nicely lit face, interesting background.  The space between the wood with the green showing through distracts from the power of the face tho''. I wish the paws were included.</td>', 'nicely lit face, interesting background.  The space between the wood with the green showing through distracts from the power of the face tho''. I wish the paws were included.', '2004-01-21 13:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(552344, 55499, 7628, '<td valign="top">Dramatic colors and clouds.  Nice "frame" made by the posts (upper right would be better if top of post wasn;t cut off).  Wish there were a spot of light to illuminate the foreground - so dark compared to the sky that you have to squint to see the lovely texture in the sand and are those crabs?</td>', 'Dramatic colors and clouds.  Nice "frame" made by the posts (upper right would be better if top of post wasn;t cut off).  Wish there were a spot of light to illuminate the foreground - so dark compared to the sky that you have to squint to see the lovely texture in the sand and are those crabs?', '2004-01-21 13:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(552348, 55695, 7628, '<td valign="top">Careful composition - the lines all come together nicely.  I like the patterns and colors of the columns.  Lacks a point of interest - a person peeking from behind a column, or sitting with legs dangling... something to catch your eye, break up the regularity of the lines.</td>', 'Careful composition - the lines all come together nicely.  I like the patterns and colors of the columns.  Lacks a point of interest - a person peeking from behind a column, or sitting with legs dangling... something to catch your eye, break up the regularity of the lines.', '2004-01-21 13:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(552351, 55746, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very grand and proper.  The blue light is unearthly contrasting with the warm spotlight on the bronze.  Perhaps a more interesting angle would give more drama, visual motion - an angle from lower down below George, making the dome a halo over his head?</td>', 'Very grand and proper.  The blue light is unearthly contrasting with the warm spotlight on the bronze.  Perhaps a more interesting angle would give more drama, visual motion - an angle from lower down below George, making the dome a halo over his head?', '2004-01-21 13:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(552354, 55821, 7628, '<td valign="top">A carpet of clouds!  It took me a minute to see.  My eyes are drawn more by the silouetted pine.  I think it would be better with the clouds being your main attraction - they are unusual, the tree isn''t.  Perhaps moving the tree to the edge of the photo, with the trunk framing one side, and then the spreading clouds sweeping out below?</td>', 'A carpet of clouds!  It took me a minute to see.  My eyes are drawn more by the silouetted pine.  I think it would be better with the clouds being your main attraction - they are unusual, the tree isn''t.  Perhaps moving the tree to the edge of the photo, with the trunk framing one side, and then the spreading clouds sweeping out below?', '2004-01-21 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(552358, 55536, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good colors. You created a fairly good picture of rural life. For me, the picture is too busy and is out of season(Christmas cards and decorations).  I can see a wall plug right behind your subject so the title doesn''t fit the picture.  I do see that she is living in a pretty rustic place and you did a great job with your lighting.</td>', 'Good colors. You created a fairly good picture of rural life. For me, the picture is too busy and is out of season(Christmas cards and decorations).  I can see a wall plug right behind your subject so the title doesn''t fit the picture.  I do see that she is living in a pretty rustic place and you did a great job with your lighting.', '2004-01-21 14:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(552359, 55045, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail in the paws and tail - you can feel the sharpness and softness.  Looks like he moved his head a bit, it isn''t as clear. Maybe a crop from the top and the left would bring the composition together more.</td>', 'Lovely detail in the paws and tail - you can feel the sharpness and softness.  Looks like he moved his head a bit, it isn''t as clear. Maybe a crop from the top and the left would bring the composition together more.', '2004-01-21 14:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(552360, 55822, 11800, '<td valign="top">Ahh. It''s a beautiful dream.</td>', 'Ahh. It''s a beautiful dream.', '2004-01-21 14:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(552363, 55403, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice studio shot.  Mask is well lit, colors are great.  Wish foreground were totally black - I can see some of the fols of the cloth, and it distracts a bit.</td>', 'Nice studio shot.  Mask is well lit, colors are great.  Wish foreground were totally black - I can see some of the fols of the cloth, and it distracts a bit.', '2004-01-21 14:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(552366, 55402, 3540, '<td valign="top">awesome abstract.  This is just really well composed and a great capture.  Excellent job 10</td>', 'awesome abstract.  This is just really well composed and a great capture.  Excellent job 10', '2004-01-21 14:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(552370, 55316, 11800, '<td valign="top">Pier. Couldn''t resist. The water in front looks really funky in a pleasant sort of way. SO much so, I find myself studying it more than the swans. What an opportunity for a cool abstract! Seems they are more in focus that the swans.</td>', 'Pier. Couldn''t resist. The water in front looks really funky in a pleasant sort of way. SO much so, I find myself studying it more than the swans. What an opportunity for a cool abstract! Seems they are more in focus that the swans.', '2004-01-21 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(552384, 55522, 7628, '<td valign="top">I never tire of looking at this picture.  It is just marvelous.  The whirling snow against the gray background gives us a sense of movement, cold, environment.  The warm soft bright bird really pops out of the background at the viewer - somehow both solidly and precariously perches on the curve of metal.  The birds expression is so determined.  I love the contrast between the bright smooth beak, striations of the wing feathers, and the soft fluffy breast feathers.  And the touvh o snowflakes dusting her face. 10</td>', 'I never tire of looking at this picture.  It is just marvelous.  The whirling snow against the gray background gives us a sense of movement, cold, environment.  The warm soft bright bird really pops out of the background at the viewer - somehow both solidly and precariously perches on the curve of metal.  The birds expression is so determined.  I love the contrast between the bright smooth beak, striations of the wing feathers, and the soft fluffy breast feathers.  And the touvh o snowflakes dusting her face. 10', '2004-01-21 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(552389, 55706, 7628, '<td valign="top">What interesting texture - is this mud spead over the face and dried and cracking?  The contast between that dry flat texture and those bright shining eyes is wonderful.  The face emerges from the shadows subtlely topped with a red cloth and closed at the bottom with the white necklace.  Wish the whole necklace were visible.</td>', 'What interesting texture - is this mud spead over the face and dried and cracking?  The contast between that dry flat texture and those bright shining eyes is wonderful.  The face emerges from the shadows subtlely topped with a red cloth and closed at the bottom with the white necklace.  Wish the whole necklace were visible.', '2004-01-21 14:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(552392, 55790, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. The light coming in from the window really adds to the mood that time indeed does stand still within this structure.  I must say that it seems that there are details and sharpness that were erased, perhaps from using a noise reduction program. Whatever happened, it makes unexpected places within the picture seem foggy and that causes some discomfort when viewing it. The main problem areas are the right headlight and bumper, and the tricycle and to a lesser degree the horse things on the right and the back wall. I do like it a lot but feel that more work or a reshoot is in order.</td>', 'Wonderful. The light coming in from the window really adds to the mood that time indeed does stand still within this structure.  I must say that it seems that there are details and sharpness that were erased, perhaps from using a noise reduction program. Whatever happened, it makes unexpected places within the picture seem foggy and that causes some discomfort when viewing it. The main problem areas are the right headlight and bumper, and the tricycle and to a lesser degree the horse things on the right and the back wall. I do like it a lot but feel that more work or a reshoot is in order.', '2004-01-21 14:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(552394, 55797, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wow those wiskers pop!  Nice use of DOF. What a fierce expression - those pointy white teeth, the ears twisted just so.  My cats wish they looked this intimidating!</td>', 'Wow those wiskers pop!  Nice use of DOF. What a fierce expression - those pointy white teeth, the ears twisted just so.  My cats wish they looked this intimidating!', '2004-01-21 14:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(552397, 55483, 7628, '<td valign="top">Picture perfect composition, colors, meaning.  Couldn''t be better. 10</td>', 'Picture perfect composition, colors, meaning.  Couldn''t be better. 10', '2004-01-21 14:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(552404, 55507, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, meaningful effect having the people walking by - you feel the motion perfectly.  The fence frames the other side of your subject and works visually and thematically - he is fenced in my people''s blindness.  Having your suject so dark, and placed one third of the way in fro the right balances the composition, gives space for the movement of passers-by which is the other subject of the picture. Well done.  I''d like to see what it would look like with the distance darkened up a bit - the brightness is a bit distracting. 9</td>', 'Wonderful, meaningful effect having the people walking by - you feel the motion perfectly.  The fence frames the other side of your subject and works visually and thematically - he is fenced in my people''s blindness.  Having your suject so dark, and placed one third of the way in fro the right balances the composition, gives space for the movement of passers-by which is the other subject of the picture. Well done.  I''d like to see what it would look like with the distance darkened up a bit - the brightness is a bit distracting. 9', '2004-01-21 14:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(552410, 55424, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a lovely black and white.  I love the imbalance in the composition - the curve in the road and the trees fill the bottom with interest, contrast, detail.  The airy sky floats above taking up most of the picture.  Perhaps the diversion isn''t the turn in the road, but into another dimension: up!  Has the feeling of a 17th cent Dutch landscape painting. I''m not sure I''v ever seen anything like this in NG, but I''d like to see it on my wall.</td>', 'What a lovely black and white.  I love the imbalance in the composition - the curve in the road and the trees fill the bottom with interest, contrast, detail.  The airy sky floats above taking up most of the picture.  Perhaps the diversion isn''t the turn in the road, but into another dimension: up!  Has the feeling of a 17th cent Dutch landscape painting. I''m not sure I''v ever seen anything like this in NG, but I''d like to see it on my wall.', '2004-01-21 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(552420, 55536, 7628, '<td valign="top">A nice "slice of life" picture.  You can see so much of this woman''s life in the details around her.  Nice even lighting.  I''d crop in more on the left, and I''d like to see a bit more of the foreground and the xmas tree (rt) - would pull the viewer into the picture from the front, focus the composition a bit more. 8</td>', 'A nice "slice of life" picture.  You can see so much of this woman''s life in the details around her.  Nice even lighting.  I''d crop in more on the left, and I''d like to see a bit more of the foreground and the xmas tree (rt) - would pull the viewer into the picture from the front, focus the composition a bit more. 8', '2004-01-21 14:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(552427, 55815, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a cool subject.  Gives us a window into a world we don;''t usually see - that theme is very NG.  Composition is good, web seems to hang from the edges of the picture.  The blues ansd oranges work well together.</td>', 'What a cool subject.  Gives us a window into a world we don;''t usually see - that theme is very NG.  Composition is good, web seems to hang from the edges of the picture.  The blues ansd oranges work well together.', '2004-01-21 14:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(552433, 55316, 7628, '<td valign="top">The swans are graceful and nicely captured, but my favorite part of the photo is the patterns in the water in the foreground!  The way you have composed the picture tells me you like them too.</td>', 'The swans are graceful and nicely captured, but my favorite part of the photo is the patterns in the water in the foreground!  The way you have composed the picture tells me you like them too.', '2004-01-21 14:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
