(552952, 55747, 10768, '<td valign="top">You managed to capture a terrific expression.  Love the title.  Nice composition.  Well done.</td>', 'You managed to capture a terrific expression.  Love the title.  Nice composition.  Well done.', '2004-01-21 22:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(552999, 55483, 14219, '<td valign="top">This one is the winner in my book.  Tremendous use of the theme, colors, and focus...GREAT balance.  This photo is one of 3 that really spoke to me...FANTASTIC JOB!</td>', 'This one is the winner in my book.  Tremendous use of the theme, colors, and focus...GREAT balance.  This photo is one of 3 that really spoke to me...FANTASTIC JOB!', '2004-01-21 23:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(553002, 55507, 14219, '<td valign="top">AMAZING PICTURE!  Great use of theme, color and subject balance.  A definite winner!</td>', 'AMAZING PICTURE!  Great use of theme, color and subject balance.  A definite winner!', '2004-01-21 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(553004, 55774, 14219, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t quite sure how this fit into the over-all theme, but what a clever picture!  Nice use of depth of field to draw the eye to that cute little face.  Very playful and fun!</td>', 'I wasn''t quite sure how this fit into the over-all theme, but what a clever picture!  Nice use of depth of field to draw the eye to that cute little face.  Very playful and fun!', '2004-01-21 23:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(553005, 55694, 16438, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2004-01-21 23:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553006, 55790, 14219, '<td valign="top">SIMPLY MAGNIFICANT!  Very well thought out...I LOVE the vintage theme! This has professional photo written all over it!  (I''m jealous!)</td>', 'SIMPLY MAGNIFICANT!  Very well thought out...I LOVE the vintage theme! This has professional photo written all over it!  (I''m jealous!)', '2004-01-21 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(553017, 55563, 6477, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful and enigmatic place! I''m looking forward to see where is it...<br/>the light here is pretty good (the time of the day), maybe with a little more contrast would be better for me. Congratulations for your good work...</td>', 'This is a beautiful and enigmatic place! I''m looking forward to see where is it...the light here is pretty good (the time of the day), maybe with a little more contrast would be better for me. Congratulations for your good work...', '2004-01-22 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(553021, 55424, 6477, '<td valign="top">Great composition, light and tones!</td>', 'Great composition, light and tones!', '2004-01-22 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(553024, 55695, 6477, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous choice for a NG photography. I like the angle and the perspective of the archs. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Gorgeous choice for a NG photography. I like the angle and the perspective of the archs. Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-01-22 00:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(553033, 55816, 6477, '<td valign="top">Amazing perspective and colors! Beautiful shot...</td>', 'Amazing perspective and colors! Beautiful shot...', '2004-01-22 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(553041, 55114, 14012, '<td valign="top">seems rather dull...needs some "pop" to the color</td>', 'seems rather dull...needs some "pop" to the color', '2004-01-22 00:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(553043, 55782, 14012, '<td valign="top">good color. I like the way you filled the frame. Maybe tone the border down next time, doesn''t need to be that large.</td>', 'good color. I like the way you filled the frame. Maybe tone the border down next time, doesn''t need to be that large.', '2004-01-22 00:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(553045, 55803, 14012, '<td valign="top">I think a shallower DOF, just focusing on the Lombardi stone would have been more effective. Not sure what''s up with the border on just the sides.</td>', 'I think a shallower DOF, just focusing on the Lombardi stone would have been more effective. Not sure what''s up with the border on just the sides.', '2004-01-22 01:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(553077, 55725, 11895, '<td valign="top">wish it did not have the white thing in the background, otherwise very good</td>', 'wish it did not have the white thing in the background, otherwise very good', '2004-01-22 03:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(553088, 55642, 10170, '<td valign="top">Flawless lighting, I love it.</td>', 'Flawless lighting, I love it.', '2004-01-22 03:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(553091, 55420, 10170, '<td valign="top">Sensational.  Love the way it stands out from the backgtound, almost lookd 3d.</td>', 'Sensational.  Love the way it stands out from the backgtound, almost lookd 3d.', '2004-01-22 03:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(553094, 55815, 10170, '<td valign="top">I had no idea that happened.  Lovely shot and most unusual.</td>', 'I had no idea that happened.  Lovely shot and most unusual.', '2004-01-22 03:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(553095, 55666, 10170, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of b&amp;w, great angle, nice shot in general.</td>', 'Nice choice of b&w, great angle, nice shot in general.', '2004-01-22 03:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(553112, 55695, 3540, '<td valign="top">I could see this subject in NG.  But I don''t think it would be like this.  The lighting here is too flat.  It needs some drama with the lighting, maybe like dawn or dusk lighting which would give it warmer colors and a lot more depth.  I think this lighting has flattened this image out a lot and it doesn''t have to be this way.</td>', 'I could see this subject in NG.  But I don''t think it would be like this.  The lighting here is too flat.  It needs some drama with the lighting, maybe like dawn or dusk lighting which would give it warmer colors and a lot more depth.  I think this lighting has flattened this image out a lot and it doesn''t have to be this way.', '2004-01-22 05:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(553114, 55774, 10170, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Love the dof here.</td>', 'Cute.  Love the dof here.', '2004-01-22 05:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(553115, 55819, 3540, '<td valign="top">I understand the yellow border thing, but I don''t agree that it should be here.  The picture itself is okay.  Its pretty sharp, but the focus is not dead on.  The neck at the bottom of the frame is blown out pretty bad.  Good shallow DOF too.</td>', 'I understand the yellow border thing, but I don''t agree that it should be here.  The picture itself is okay.  Its pretty sharp, but the focus is not dead on.  The neck at the bottom of the frame is blown out pretty bad.  Good shallow DOF too.', '2004-01-22 05:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(553116, 55402, 10170, '<td valign="top">Looking forward to seeing the lens set up here.  Lovely shot.</td>', 'Looking forward to seeing the lens set up here.  Lovely shot.', '2004-01-22 05:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(553117, 54987, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is pretty good.  It reminds me a lot of the first sunrise photos I took when I really got into photography.  Same kinds of warm colors and hot suns.</td>', 'This is pretty good.  It reminds me a lot of the first sunrise photos I took when I really got into photography.  Same kinds of warm colors and hot suns.', '2004-01-22 05:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(553118, 55738, 6999, '<td valign="top">An almost great shot - just that area of over-bright distortion top left, which is a shame, but hopefully won''t hurt your votes too much. Without that, I think greater contrast would help bring out the interruption of rhythm caused by the cow more, but I guess that bright area prevents that. 8</td>', 'An almost great shot - just that area of over-bright distortion top left, which is a shame, but hopefully won''t hurt your votes too much. Without that, I think greater contrast would help bring out the interruption of rhythm caused by the cow more, but I guess that bright area prevents that. 8', '2004-01-22 05:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(553119, 55666, 6999, '<td valign="top">Horribly familiar, but I can''t place it. Fabulous juxtaposition, great message, ideal for the challenge. Can''t help but wonder if compositionally you could have given the impression of the new road dominating the house a bit more had you shot from a lower angle - perhaps it''s just the white of the house, but it doesn''t seeem over-shadowed by the bridge enough ... but also, perhaps there''s a message of surviving adversity here too. 9</td>', 'Horribly familiar, but I can''t place it. Fabulous juxtaposition, great message, ideal for the challenge. Can''t help but wonder if compositionally you could have given the impression of the new road dominating the house a bit more had you shot from a lower angle - perhaps it''s just the white of the house, but it doesn''t seeem over-shadowed by the bridge enough ... but also, perhaps there''s a message of surviving adversity here too. 9', '2004-01-22 05:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(553120, 55747, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ideal entry, and a great natural candid. Anthropomophic title bothers me a touch, and oh to be able to burn those eyes a little. Great moment of light though. I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t ribbon.</td>', 'Ideal entry, and a great natural candid. Anthropomophic title bothers me a touch, and oh to be able to burn those eyes a little. Great moment of light though. I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t ribbon.', '2004-01-22 06:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(553121, 55752, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost a classic, this. If it weren''t quite so obvious only ... still scores well for me. There''s a slight lack of definition however - a scattery kind of pixelation (almost) to the hair, almost an impressionistic thing rather than a great problem. 8</td>', 'Almost a classic, this. If it weren''t quite so obvious only ... still scores well for me. There''s a slight lack of definition however - a scattery kind of pixelation (almost) to the hair, almost an impressionistic thing rather than a great problem. 8', '2004-01-22 06:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(553122, 55788, 6999, '<td valign="top">Was going to write nonsense about how no-one''s been to Mars yet, but I guess this is part of some confectionary. Clever (willing to bet too clever for most here). Just think your organisation of those shapes within the frame is oddly unsatisfactory - but it remains a neat shot. Perhaps Image <i>of</i> Mars would be a more honest title?</td>', 'Was going to write nonsense about how no-one''s been to Mars yet, but I guess this is part of some confectionary. Clever (willing to bet too clever for most here). Just think your organisation of those shapes within the frame is oddly unsatisfactory - but it remains a neat shot. Perhaps Image of Mars would be a more honest title?', '2004-01-22 06:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(553123, 55767, 3540, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot.  To me it looks a little bit overexposed.  I think it would tone down the glare on the windows but maintain the details in the men''s faces.  This is a pretty photojournalistic shot and those can be found in NG as well as all the animals and stuff too.  Good luck 7</td>', 'Pretty good shot.  To me it looks a little bit overexposed.  I think it would tone down the glare on the windows but maintain the details in the men''s faces.  This is a pretty photojournalistic shot and those can be found in NG as well as all the animals and stuff too.  Good luck 7', '2004-01-22 06:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(553125, 55209, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully crazy shot. Just perhaps a touch too confusing and odd, especially in this framing - I think more negative space would give the shapes more room to ''breathe'' if you understand me - this way, it gives the impression of being caged, of being forced into that peculiar pose, and I think that takes away some of the impact of the shot.</td>', 'Wonderfully crazy shot. Just perhaps a touch too confusing and odd, especially in this framing - I think more negative space would give the shapes more room to ''breathe'' if you understand me - this way, it gives the impression of being caged, of being forced into that peculiar pose, and I think that takes away some of the impact of the shot.', '2004-01-22 06:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(553126, 55671, 3540, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but not a great shot.  Tough one to expose just right, if indeed it is possible.  I have my doubts looking at this because the top right corner is way hot and the top left corner is really dark.  I think there is no medium which means you must sacrifice one part for the other.  That puts you in a lose-lose situation.  Maybe a different angle on this would''ve left you more options.</td>', 'A good idea, but not a great shot.  Tough one to expose just right, if indeed it is possible.  I have my doubts looking at this because the top right corner is way hot and the top left corner is really dark.  I think there is no medium which means you must sacrifice one part for the other.  That puts you in a lose-lose situation.  Maybe a different angle on this would''ve left you more options.', '2004-01-22 06:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(553128, 55316, 6999, '<td valign="top">Your work is becoming instantly recognisable M. Beguin. No bad thing, either. Reflections bottom frame are fabulous, the parallel poses of the swans add balance, just sufficiently disturbed by their not being mirror images of one another, quite.  There''s an odd effect given by the upper-two-thirds composition, similar to your point of view shot, where the lower part of frame, those reflections, almost seem to belong ot another image entirely. <br/> <br/>A radio produceer I know once told me that you should always try to have at least two things going on in anything you produce ... this is just more proof of that, I suppose.<br/> <br/> <br/>PS. This better had be a JJ photo, after all that :-)</td>', 'Your work is becoming instantly recognisable M. Beguin. No bad thing, either. Reflections bottom frame are fabulous, the parallel poses of the swans add balance, just sufficiently disturbed by their not being mirror images of one another, quite.  There''s an odd effect given by the upper-two-thirds composition, similar to your point of view shot, where the lower part of frame, those reflections, almost seem to belong ot another image entirely.  A radio produceer I know once told me that you should always try to have at least two things going on in anything you produce ... this is just more proof of that, I suppose.  PS. This better had be a JJ photo, after all that :-)', '2004-01-22 06:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(553129, 55501, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent pic.  What is this at?  f/16?  this is some awesome DOF.  Tremendous color too.  Great job 9</td>', 'Excellent pic.  What is this at?  f/16?  this is some awesome DOF.  Tremendous color too.  Great job 9', '2004-01-22 06:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(553130, 55563, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great building.  Dreary day.  I bet this would really look great in the springtime.  Well taken.  Just not the best day to take it.</td>', 'Great building.  Dreary day.  I bet this would really look great in the springtime.  Well taken.  Just not the best day to take it.', '2004-01-22 06:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(553141, 55778, 3540, '<td valign="top">A little tight on top.  There seems to be a shadow in the water in front too that almost looks like a camera.  Just a little tiny bit out of focus.  Otherwise, not too bad</td>', 'A little tight on top.  There seems to be a shadow in the water in front too that almost looks like a camera.  Just a little tiny bit out of focus.  Otherwise, not too bad', '2004-01-22 07:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(553143, 55759, 3540, '<td valign="top">The colors are bright, but the picture is not crisp.  Good subject and really the overall composition is very good.  The quality of the photo is just not where it needs to be, especially for this type of shot.</td>', 'The colors are bright, but the picture is not crisp.  Good subject and really the overall composition is very good.  The quality of the photo is just not where it needs to be, especially for this type of shot.', '2004-01-22 07:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(553146, 55353, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting textures. You get the feeling of the roughness of the rock. This image screams b&amp;w. The contrast is pretty good.</td>', 'Very interesting textures. You get the feeling of the roughness of the rock. This image screams b&w. The contrast is pretty good.', '2004-01-22 07:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(553149, 55522, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Good still, and also good motion with the flakes aflyin''.  The colors seem a little bit off.  Maybe its just a regional thing.  Ours are still pretty red around here.8</td>', 'Great shot.  Good still, and also good motion with the flakes aflyin''.  The colors seem a little bit off.  Maybe its just a regional thing.  Ours are still pretty red around here.8', '2004-01-22 07:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(553150, 55363, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is interesting with the road leading your eyes toward the fog. The tree in the right side of the picture also helps by adding interest.</td>', 'Composition is interesting with the road leading your eyes toward the fog. The tree in the right side of the picture also helps by adding interest.', '2004-01-22 07:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(553153, 55642, 3540, '<td valign="top">This appears to me to be a photo that was not taken in perfect focus.  Looks to me like you sharpened it more, or tried to anyway.  The image quality is suffering a bit from it.  A good idea for this photo though.</td>', 'This appears to me to be a photo that was not taken in perfect focus.  Looks to me like you sharpened it more, or tried to anyway.  The image quality is suffering a bit from it.  A good idea for this photo though.', '2004-01-22 07:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(553154, 55581, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sky seems a little bit off.  Looks like a little noisy maybe.  It has some nice colors, but I don''t really see the point of this photo.</td>', 'The sky seems a little bit off.  Looks like a little noisy maybe.  It has some nice colors, but I don''t really see the point of this photo.', '2004-01-22 07:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(553155, 55744, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is not the greatest quality of photo.  It is nicely composed and very topic appropriate.  It''s cutting off their heads though and it isn''t super clear.  This has a ton of potential to be a great shot, just not this one.</td>', 'This is not the greatest quality of photo.  It is nicely composed and very topic appropriate.  It''s cutting off their heads though and it isn''t super clear.  This has a ton of potential to be a great shot, just not this one.', '2004-01-22 07:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(553170, 55769, 714, '<td valign="top">I really like this because it is different from your average animal or scenery shot.    The leading lines and composition are great.  very well shot photo.  10 in my book.</td>', 'I really like this because it is different from your average animal or scenery shot.    The leading lines and composition are great.  very well shot photo.  10 in my book.', '2004-01-22 08:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(553184, 55771, 12802, '<td valign="top">I''m going to say that this is absolutely horrible, I hope you get loads and loads of ones.....  Only because it''s better than mine :-(<br/> <br/>So nice, brilliant colours, brilliant background.... too bloody brilliant! :-)  Maybe could have done with a wee bit of unsharp mask to bring out some more details, but seriously though, well done!  A very nice shot! 9</td>', 'I''m going to say that this is absolutely horrible, I hope you get loads and loads of ones.....  Only because it''s better than mine :-( So nice, brilliant colours, brilliant background.... too bloody brilliant! :-)  Maybe could have done with a wee bit of unsharp mask to bring out some more details, but seriously though, well done!  A very nice shot! 9', '2004-01-22 08:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
