(553631, 55822, 16352, '<td valign="top">can''t make my mind up on this - one minute i like it - then it feels too empty - then i like it again</td>', 'can''t make my mind up on this - one minute i like it - then it feels too empty - then i like it again', '2004-01-22 14:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
