(553635, 55756, 16352, '<td valign="top">unusual angle - i like this - almost seems to be roaring at the sun</td>', 'unusual angle - i like this - almost seems to be roaring at the sun', '2004-01-22 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(553636, 55507, 16352, '<td valign="top">love the way that the long exposure has not made the people flow gently  - they almose seem to be "marching past"</td>', 'love the way that the long exposure has not made the people flow gently  - they almose seem to be "marching past"', '2004-01-22 14:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(553637, 55123, 16352, '<td valign="top">love the thistle but (it may just be me) the bee seems out of focus. Also a shame the bee is facing away from the lens</td>', 'love the thistle but (it may just be me) the bee seems out of focus. Also a shame the bee is facing away from the lens', '2004-01-22 14:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(553639, 55669, 16352, '<td valign="top">shame about the blue corner - detracts my eye too much from the subject which is beautifully focussed</td>', 'shame about the blue corner - detracts my eye too much from the subject which is beautifully focussed', '2004-01-22 14:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(553642, 55501, 16352, '<td valign="top">the colours are beatiful - it is just like I am looking through a window and really there but nothing "grabs" my eye. I keep looking to see what I should be looking at.</td>', 'the colours are beatiful - it is just like I am looking through a window and really there but nothing "grabs" my eye. I keep looking to see what I should be looking at.', '2004-01-22 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(553647, 55747, 16352, '<td valign="top">love the subject but the lighting looks totally staged.  Juxtaposition of what seems to be studio lighting against such a beautiful "beast" just does not work</td>', 'love the subject but the lighting looks totally staged.  Juxtaposition of what seems to be studio lighting against such a beautiful "beast" just does not work', '2004-01-22 14:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(553649, 55581, 16352, '<td valign="top">sorry - there is nothing to "grab"</td>', 'sorry - there is nothing to "grab"', '2004-01-22 14:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(553651, 55737, 16352, '<td valign="top">sorry the fingernail is just too intrusive. I know the finger gives a wonderful sense of scale but the bright white of the nail takes over the focus of the picture</td>', 'sorry the fingernail is just too intrusive. I know the finger gives a wonderful sense of scale but the bright white of the nail takes over the focus of the picture', '2004-01-22 14:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(553652, 55816, 16352, '<td valign="top">beautiful colour but did the angle need to be so obtuse - made me think of the camera angles on batman. The dead reeds are interesting enough (being so drab) against that beautiful water</td>', 'beautiful colour but did the angle need to be so obtuse - made me think of the camera angles on batman. The dead reeds are interesting enough (being so drab) against that beautiful water', '2004-01-22 14:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553653, 55483, 16352, '<td valign="top">love it....what a shame about the plastic bag though</td>', 'love it....what a shame about the plastic bag though', '2004-01-22 14:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(553659, 55729, 16352, '<td valign="top">shame about the dark area bottom right. has unbalanced the picture. with so much going on in the frame it would have been better filled. possiby if the exposure had been earlier and the bright lights at the bottom had left a trail more centrally - they would have looked good running parralel with the pavement lights</td>', 'shame about the dark area bottom right. has unbalanced the picture. with so much going on in the frame it would have been better filled. possiby if the exposure had been earlier and the bright lights at the bottom had left a trail more centrally - they would have looked good running parralel with the pavement lights', '2004-01-22 14:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(553660, 55707, 16352, '<td valign="top">just seems a little clinical, now if they were pictured on the grass/ground they would have had a sense of scale and "BEEN AT GETTYSBURG"</td>', 'just seems a little clinical, now if they were pictured on the grass/ground they would have had a sense of scale and "BEEN AT GETTYSBURG"', '2004-01-22 14:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
