(553672, 55769, 16352, '<td valign="top">Didn''t like this at first - except for it being so beautifully focussed and perfectly exposed - Then the humour of it got me - They look like the 3 (4) monkeys. Love it</td>', 'Didn''t like this at first - except for it being so beautifully focussed and perfectly exposed - Then the humour of it got me - They look like the 3 (4) monkeys. Love it', '2004-01-22 14:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(553677, 55567, 16455, '<td valign="top">I have not words to comment this picture, maybe a little dark at the left, but one of the best picture I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'I have not words to comment this picture, maybe a little dark at the left, but one of the best picture I''ve ever seen.', '2004-01-22 15:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(553747, 55587, 4090, '<td valign="top">sharp, composure is great , 10/10 ... could see this on ng easy</td>', 'sharp, composure is great , 10/10 ... could see this on ng easy', '2004-01-22 16:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(553750, 55574, 4090, '<td valign="top">stunning , great framing 10/10 good luck</td>', 'stunning , great framing 10/10 good luck', '2004-01-22 16:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(553752, 55779, 4090, '<td valign="top">great photo but IMHO a tad sharper is needed on the eyes</td>', 'great photo but IMHO a tad sharper is needed on the eyes', '2004-01-22 16:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(553754, 55522, 4090, '<td valign="top">amazing photo 9/10</td>', 'amazing photo 9/10', '2004-01-22 16:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(553773, 55775, 11800, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower, the colors are perfect and the shallow dof is exactly right. I like the framing also. It looks like you cropped a lot out of the picture and the resized it. It does degrade the quality of the picture somewhat when that happens. Or maybe you used the digital zoom part of your zoom?</td>', 'Lovely flower, the colors are perfect and the shallow dof is exactly right. I like the framing also. It looks like you cropped a lot out of the picture and the resized it. It does degrade the quality of the picture somewhat when that happens. Or maybe you used the digital zoom part of your zoom?', '2004-01-22 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(553776, 55767, 11800, '<td valign="top">Are they protesting atomic energy?  Looks like a peaceful protest. Good job.</td>', 'Are they protesting atomic energy?  Looks like a peaceful protest. Good job.', '2004-01-22 16:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(553777, 54901, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great atmosphere, lovely depth due to mist and colors. The sky looked very strange at first, but with your explanation that it was trees and not sky, I now see it. Such a wonderful picture from such a simple scene.</td>', 'Great atmosphere, lovely depth due to mist and colors. The sky looked very strange at first, but with your explanation that it was trees and not sky, I now see it. Such a wonderful picture from such a simple scene.', '2004-01-22 16:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(553780, 55471, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good title. I think it would have more impact if it was taken at sunset. It seems too dark to me, but maybe it''s my monitor, although I haven''t had this problem with other pictures in this challenge.</td>', 'Good title. I think it would have more impact if it was taken at sunset. It seems too dark to me, but maybe it''s my monitor, although I haven''t had this problem with other pictures in this challenge.', '2004-01-22 16:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(553782, 55567, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s a cat. Right? I like your bold take on the subject but the way s/he is framed makes it a bit confusing. Maybe if there was more light on the nose it would help define the cat''s face more.</td>', 'It''s a cat. Right? I like your bold take on the subject but the way s/he is framed makes it a bit confusing. Maybe if there was more light on the nose it would help define the cat''s face more.', '2004-01-22 17:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(553791, 55769, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like it because of the position and activity of the four men. Good capture. Have you considered cropping this in a vertical pano with just the guys and a little to the left and right left in?  It''s really a pleasure to look at this.</td>', 'I like it because of the position and activity of the four men. Good capture. Have you considered cropping this in a vertical pano with just the guys and a little to the left and right left in?  It''s really a pleasure to look at this.', '2004-01-22 17:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(553830, 55757, 10625, '<td valign="top">not a fan of your border.  the pic itself is great</td>', 'not a fan of your border.  the pic itself is great', '2004-01-22 17:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(553879, 55587, 804, '<td valign="top">AMAZING!!! Great DOF and perfect timing. The steam from his breath really adds life to this photo.</td>', 'AMAZING!!! Great DOF and perfect timing. The steam from his breath really adds life to this photo.', '2004-01-22 18:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(553964, 55772, 10268, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good picture, but definitely fits more than any photo I''ve come to yet.</td>', 'I think this is a good picture, but definitely fits more than any photo I''ve come to yet.', '2004-01-22 19:21:08.000000', NULL, 1);
