(554095, 55123, 6477, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and colors, you were very lucky to catch this moment... the dof and focus are great, good work</td>', 'Beautiful light and colors, you were very lucky to catch this moment... the dof and focus are great, good work', '2004-01-22 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
