(554115, 55640, 10768, '<td valign="top">Wow this photo almost looks 3D.  I''m anxious to see what kind of camera and lens you used.  Outstanding!</td>', 'Wow this photo almost looks 3D.  I''m anxious to see what kind of camera and lens you used.  Outstanding!', '2004-01-22 23:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(554128, 55522, 10768, '<td valign="top">Brrrr, it looks cold!  Lovely contrasts of reds/greys.  Very nice composition.</td>', 'Brrrr, it looks cold!  Lovely contrasts of reds/greys.  Very nice composition.', '2004-01-22 23:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(554159, 55721, 15189, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge.  Creative.  Good Job!</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge.  Creative.  Good Job!', '2004-01-23 00:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(554161, 55769, 15189, '<td valign="top">Love the idea of this shot.  Creative.  High marks from me.</td>', 'Love the idea of this shot.  Creative.  High marks from me.', '2004-01-23 00:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(554162, 55218, 15189, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.  Wish we could see a little more detail in the foreground though.  Good Job!</td>', 'Very beautiful.  Wish we could see a little more detail in the foreground though.  Good Job!', '2004-01-23 00:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(554163, 55360, 15189, '<td valign="top">Gotta love cranes!  Nice shot, a little noisy around the head area, but good job overall.</td>', 'Gotta love cranes!  Nice shot, a little noisy around the head area, but good job overall.', '2004-01-23 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(554165, 55757, 15189, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The shallow DOF is a bit distracting, but good job overall!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The shallow DOF is a bit distracting, but good job overall!', '2004-01-23 00:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(554167, 55640, 15189, '<td valign="top">Aquarium shots are tough.  Good Job!</td>', 'Aquarium shots are tough.  Good Job!', '2004-01-23 00:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(554170, 55804, 15189, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly over exposed.</td>', 'Seems slightly over exposed.', '2004-01-23 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(554171, 55536, 15189, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea for NG.  Good Job!</td>', 'Very nice idea for NG.  Good Job!', '2004-01-23 00:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(554199, 55424, 4767, '<td valign="top">Good use of b&amp;w here.</td>', 'Good use of b&w here.', '2004-01-23 01:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(554200, 55758, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of that trompe l''oeil painting.  It does exactly what it''s supposed to - well seen!</td>', 'Nice shot of that trompe l''oeil painting.  It does exactly what it''s supposed to - well seen!', '2004-01-23 01:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(554201, 55807, 4767, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pen and ink drawing.  I love how cold it feels!</td>', 'Looks like a pen and ink drawing.  I love how cold it feels!', '2004-01-23 01:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(554203, 55316, 4767, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the better I like it.  The foreground affect is intriguing...</td>', 'The more I look at this the better I like it.  The foreground affect is intriguing...', '2004-01-23 01:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(554206, 55563, 4767, '<td valign="top">tundra, huh?  Nice exposure, interesting place...</td>', 'tundra, huh?  Nice exposure, interesting place...', '2004-01-23 01:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(554211, 55364, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good depth of field was captured. The background blues/greens really help to set the figure apart and makes it pop out of the shot. Contrast is good especially the dark shadows under the hat and the nose. Texture was captured beautifully. You can almost feel the roughness.</td>', 'Very good depth of field was captured. The background blues/greens really help to set the figure apart and makes it pop out of the shot. Contrast is good especially the dark shadows under the hat and the nose. Texture was captured beautifully. You can almost feel the roughness.', '2004-01-23 02:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(554212, 55501, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like how you were able to get the layers in the composition. All of them works perfectly to give a great picture. The different colors in these layers help to keep your interest in the shot and try to make out the details within. Great shot.</td>', 'I like how you were able to get the layers in the composition. All of them works perfectly to give a great picture. The different colors in these layers help to keep your interest in the shot and try to make out the details within. Great shot.', '2004-01-23 02:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(554213, 55705, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very clear contrast really brings this shot to life. Great depth of field helps to make the subject pop oput of the background. It''s neat that the other gull in the water seem to be looking at the posing one.</td>', 'Very clear contrast really brings this shot to life. Great depth of field helps to make the subject pop oput of the background. It''s neat that the other gull in the water seem to be looking at the posing one.', '2004-01-23 02:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(554214, 55811, 10084, '<td valign="top">The rail and the bridge is an interesting element that helps lead your eyes toward the distant. The bold shadow of the railing on the floor is really nice. Beautiful clouds.</td>', 'The rail and the bridge is an interesting element that helps lead your eyes toward the distant. The bold shadow of the railing on the floor is really nice. Beautiful clouds.', '2004-01-23 02:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(554215, 55523, 10084, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to breathe in the fresh air. Beautiful mountain landscape. I love the incredible shadows casted on the mountain.</td>', 'Makes me want to breathe in the fresh air. Beautiful mountain landscape. I love the incredible shadows casted on the mountain.', '2004-01-23 02:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(554217, 55574, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful depth of field. The tiger is incredibly sharp. and in focus. Texture is captured incredibly and you can almost feel the soft fur. The contrast of the green background really helps to bring out the tiger. Wonderful picture.</td>', 'Beautiful depth of field. The tiger is incredibly sharp. and in focus. Texture is captured incredibly and you can almost feel the soft fur. The contrast of the green background really helps to bring out the tiger. Wonderful picture.', '2004-01-23 02:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(554218, 55242, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good depth of field. Textures are captured beautifully. You can almost feel the softness of the feathers. The lighter colored hues of the feathers brings you eyes attention to them. Must be really warm.</td>', 'Very good depth of field. Textures are captured beautifully. You can almost feel the softness of the feathers. The lighter colored hues of the feathers brings you eyes attention to them. Must be really warm.', '2004-01-23 02:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(554219, 55424, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast really makes this shot very interesing. The road helps lead your eyes through the trees. I think a tiny bit of cropping of the sky would give this even more impact.</td>', 'Beautiful contrast really makes this shot very interesing. The road helps lead your eyes through the trees. I think a tiny bit of cropping of the sky would give this even more impact.', '2004-01-23 02:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(554223, 55772, 10084, '<td valign="top">Incredible closeup of a tender family moment in the animals''  life. This is what NG is about. You can almost feel the smoothness of the seals skin. The texture of the sand on the seals body gives a feeling of grittyness. Excellently captured.</td>', 'Incredible closeup of a tender family moment in the animals''  life. This is what NG is about. You can almost feel the smoothness of the seals skin. The texture of the sand on the seals body gives a feeling of grittyness. Excellently captured.', '2004-01-23 02:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(554224, 55209, 10084, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very dramatic. Composition is very interesting. Love the patterns of the feathers, very abstract. The tough of hightlight in the eye is awesome.</td>', 'Lighting is very dramatic. Composition is very interesting. Love the patterns of the feathers, very abstract. The tough of hightlight in the eye is awesome.', '2004-01-23 02:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(554225, 55747, 10084, '<td valign="top">This is the essence of the perfect NG shot. Maybe you should submit it to them. Lighting is almost perfect, just a touch on the rightside cheek.Texture of the hair is incredible. You can almost feel the softness. The eyes are incredible and really shows the emotion and feeling of the chimp. This is the winner.</td>', 'This is the essence of the perfect NG shot. Maybe you should submit it to them. Lighting is almost perfect, just a touch on the rightside cheek.Texture of the hair is incredible. You can almost feel the softness. The eyes are incredible and really shows the emotion and feeling of the chimp. This is the winner.', '2004-01-23 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(554226, 55522, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field. Love the great vibrant colors in the birds'' feathers. You can almost feel the soft texture of the feathers.</td>', 'Great depth of field. Love the great vibrant colors in the birds'' feathers. You can almost feel the soft texture of the feathers.', '2004-01-23 02:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(554227, 55541, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good depth of field. Texture were captured beautifully. You can almost feel the soft feathers. Contrast is really good. The yellow of the beak really stand out and brings your eyes toward the eyes of the eagle. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Very good depth of field. Texture were captured beautifully. You can almost feel the soft feathers. Contrast is really good. The yellow of the beak really stand out and brings your eyes toward the eyes of the eagle. Wonderful shot.', '2004-01-23 02:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(554229, 55778, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The way you have the subject arrange helps to lead your eyes from the head toward the bottom where the claws are just it much interest. Excellent depth of field also helps.</td>', 'Great composition. The way you have the subject arrange helps to lead your eyes from the head toward the bottom where the claws are just it much interest. Excellent depth of field also helps.', '2004-01-23 02:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(554230, 55776, 10084, '<td valign="top">The soft focus of the landscape really brings out the beautiful hues in the sky. The diagonal hues of the red/yellow brings your eyes toward the top of that hill/mountain.</td>', 'The soft focus of the landscape really brings out the beautiful hues in the sky. The diagonal hues of the red/yellow brings your eyes toward the top of that hill/mountain.', '2004-01-23 02:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(554233, 55725, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great subject with well ste light and delicate texture. Would have loved it if the background would be a little more visible. The colour of the background is great though.</td>', 'Great subject with well ste light and delicate texture. Would have loved it if the background would be a little more visible. The colour of the background is great though.', '2004-01-23 02:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(554235, 55814, 5158, '<td valign="top">I do like the strong contrast between the mask and the white background. Would have loved it to see some more details on the mask. Also the crop is too tight for my taste.<br/>Like the strong colours. Good luck!</td>', 'I do like the strong contrast between the mask and the white background. Would have loved it to see some more details on the mask. Also the crop is too tight for my taste.Like the strong colours. Good luck!', '2004-01-23 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(554236, 55790, 5158, '<td valign="top">I do like the scenery and how you composed and framed it. <br/>The softness is a bit too strong IMO, don''t know if  NG would use this style. <br/>Still, a great image.</td>', 'I do like the scenery and how you composed and framed it. The softness is a bit too strong IMO, don''t know if  NG would use this style. Still, a great image.', '2004-01-23 02:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(554238, 55767, 5158, '<td valign="top">To me this would fit better to photojournalism and for that topic it''s well made: the protesters have interesting faces and look strong.<br/>However, I don''t know thing such political iamges would be shown in NG.</td>', 'To me this would fit better to photojournalism and for that topic it''s well made: the protesters have interesting faces and look strong.However, I don''t know thing such political iamges would be shown in NG.', '2004-01-23 03:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(554264, 55316, 10268, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think it''d be a little more powerful with better cropping/framing.</td>', 'I like this, but I think it''d be a little more powerful with better cropping/framing.', '2004-01-23 05:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(554266, 55399, 3540, '<td valign="top">Maybe its just me, but this doesn''t look like a real cheetah.  I guess in all fairness, I''ve never seen one this close in person.  The thing I really don''t like about this is the lifeless eyes.  Catchlights in the eyes make them much less dead.</td>', 'Maybe its just me, but this doesn''t look like a real cheetah.  I guess in all fairness, I''ve never seen one this close in person.  The thing I really don''t like about this is the lifeless eyes.  Catchlights in the eyes make them much less dead.', '2004-01-23 05:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(554267, 55045, 3540, '<td valign="top">The exposure on the squirrel is spot on. The snow is a little bright.  Where is his cheeseburger?  You just expect him to eat fries?  This is a cute shot, but I''m not really sold on it being a great photo for this challenge.  If he were in a tree, eating curly fries, then I think I''d be more apt to vote it higher.  Really, its a good shot of the squirrel.  I''m just not keen on the environment you shot him in.</td>', 'The exposure on the squirrel is spot on. The snow is a little bright.  Where is his cheeseburger?  You just expect him to eat fries?  This is a cute shot, but I''m not really sold on it being a great photo for this challenge.  If he were in a tree, eating curly fries, then I think I''d be more apt to vote it higher.  Really, its a good shot of the squirrel.  I''m just not keen on the environment you shot him in.', '2004-01-23 05:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(554268, 55408, 3540, '<td valign="top">High quality stuff.  Great shot.  Very well framed and excellent exposure.  The cut jems on the bottom are a little to arranged for my tastes.   That takes nothing away from your technical prowess.  Good work 8</td>', 'High quality stuff.  Great shot.  Very well framed and excellent exposure.  The cut jems on the bottom are a little to arranged for my tastes.   That takes nothing away from your technical prowess.  Good work 8', '2004-01-23 05:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(554270, 55123, 3540, '<td valign="top">The bee is moving too fast or he isn''t in your focal plane.  The thistle''s pickers seem to be in focus but the bee is too blurry.  The colors don''t pop like they should either.  I''m wondering what ISO this was shot in.</td>', 'The bee is moving too fast or he isn''t in your focal plane.  The thistle''s pickers seem to be in focus but the bee is too blurry.  The colors don''t pop like they should either.  I''m wondering what ISO this was shot in.', '2004-01-23 05:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(554274, 55420, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Maybe just a pinch dark.  The expression is great.  The detail is very good as well.  Nice work 9</td>', 'Great shot.  Maybe just a pinch dark.  The expression is great.  The detail is very good as well.  Nice work 9', '2004-01-23 05:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(554281, 55507, 3540, '<td valign="top">The framing of this shot couldn''t be better.  This is an excellent photojournalistic shot with some good creative stuff too.   It is emotive and visually impacting and I think a great shot.  Outside of the buliding is just a little extra hot.  I totally understand why, but it still is hot.  So you''ll have to settle for 9</td>', 'The framing of this shot couldn''t be better.  This is an excellent photojournalistic shot with some good creative stuff too.   It is emotive and visually impacting and I think a great shot.  Outside of the buliding is just a little extra hot.  I totally understand why, but it still is hot.  So you''ll have to settle for 9', '2004-01-23 05:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(554284, 55403, 3540, '<td valign="top">excellent color.  Good sharp clear crisp pic.  I can see this still life being a possible NG choice, but I don''t say that with a lot of conviction.  It is a very nice illustration of these pieces.</td>', 'excellent color.  Good sharp clear crisp pic.  I can see this still life being a possible NG choice, but I don''t say that with a lot of conviction.  It is a very nice illustration of these pieces.', '2004-01-23 05:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(554285, 55738, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would be a more effective picture if the beast''s head wasn''t buried in the grassy stuff.  Nice warm colors.</td>', 'This would be a more effective picture if the beast''s head wasn''t buried in the grassy stuff.  Nice warm colors.', '2004-01-23 06:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(554292, 55721, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m almost done with all the pictures and I must say, this one is the most pro-looking one of the bunch. The light is a little off, but you gathered all your props nicely,  they are in a pleasing arrangement within the frame and you have a  title that supports the photo. Good job. Not a "wow" photo, but it is a "pro" one.<br/>Edit: Now that I think of it, it would be a better fit with "Newsweek" or some magazine of that type. But you still keep your 10.</td>', 'I''m almost done with all the pictures and I must say, this one is the most pro-looking one of the bunch. The light is a little off, but you gathered all your props nicely,  they are in a pleasing arrangement within the frame and you have a  title that supports the photo. Good job. Not a "wow" photo, but it is a "pro" one.Edit: Now that I think of it, it would be a better fit with "Newsweek" or some magazine of that type. But you still keep your 10.', '2004-01-23 06:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(554350, 55230, 16352, '<td valign="top">shame the boy is so central - would have been nice to see him moving just into or out of shot. BUT excellent panning. Spot on</td>', 'shame the boy is so central - would have been nice to see him moving just into or out of shot. BUT excellent panning. Spot on', '2004-01-23 09:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(554353, 55285, 16352, '<td valign="top">I see the idea and I like the patterns. Personall (and I know this is a very personal observation) it would have been nice to see a greater depth of field.</td>', 'I see the idea and I like the patterns. Personall (and I know this is a very personal observation) it would have been nice to see a greater depth of field.', '2004-01-23 09:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(554355, 55695, 16352, '<td valign="top">Lovely muted colours, white whites and black blacks. The only thing that distracts me is the top left corner. It may look less intrusive if the left side was cropped out. It would mean losing a column but would balance the picture (I think)</td>', 'Lovely muted colours, white whites and black blacks. The only thing that distracts me is the top left corner. It may look less intrusive if the left side was cropped out. It would mean losing a column but would balance the picture (I think)', '2004-01-23 09:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(554357, 55484, 16352, '<td valign="top">I do and I don''t like this one. I know the eye is the main focal point but it seems just too bright. I manipulated it and toned down the eye and it seemed less intrusive but still kept the point.</td>', 'I do and I don''t like this one. I know the eye is the main focal point but it seems just too bright. I manipulated it and toned down the eye and it seemed less intrusive but still kept the point.', '2004-01-23 09:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(554358, 55790, 16352, '<td valign="top">I really liked this but feel that the left hand car could be cropped outthe background looks almost painted. Really beautiful rich colours.</td>', 'I really liked this but feel that the left hand car could be cropped outthe background looks almost painted. Really beautiful rich colours.', '2004-01-23 09:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(554359, 55747, 8860, '<td valign="top">That is a wonderful expression you''ve managed to capture. Beautiful lighting too. Has to be a front runner. [10]</td>', 'That is a wonderful expression you''ve managed to capture. Beautiful lighting too. Has to be a front runner. [10]', '2004-01-23 09:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
