(554383, 55797, 16352, '<td valign="top">Really nice expression. Beautiful facial focus. But it seems that there is too much retouching on its back (right side). If you crop the picture right in - just keeping the eyes nose mouth and tongue in, it retains its beauty and looks fantastic. It would have got a 9 but have had to mark lower sorry.</td>', 'Really nice expression. Beautiful facial focus. But it seems that there is too much retouching on its back (right side). If you crop the picture right in - just keeping the eyes nose mouth and tongue in, it retains its beauty and looks fantastic. It would have got a 9 but have had to mark lower sorry.', '2004-01-23 09:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
