(554759, 55771, 11800, '<td valign="top">Excellent texture and detail and color and light. The composition is confusing. I was looking at his hoody and thinking, what a nose! Is that what the title was about? I see, there''s a bug on the hemp?</td>', 'Excellent texture and detail and color and light. The composition is confusing. I was looking at his hoody and thinking, what a nose! Is that what the title was about? I see, there''s a bug on the hemp?', '2004-01-23 16:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
