(554768, 55285, 11800, '<td valign="top">This might have done nice in "pwl". I like the wild colors and the dof. There isn''t enough information to know it''s a feather, but it sure is a pretty abstract.</td>', 'This might have done nice in "pwl". I like the wild colors and the dof. There isn''t enough information to know it''s a feather, but it sure is a pretty abstract.', '2004-01-23 16:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(554770, 54901, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of negative space. Details are amazing. Not sure if the fog/haze affected the sky or not but I would have liked to see a bit more blue up there as that would complemented the green at the bottom quite nicely.</td>', 'Great composition and use of negative space. Details are amazing. Not sure if the fog/haze affected the sky or not but I would have liked to see a bit more blue up there as that would complemented the green at the bottom quite nicely.', '2004-01-23 16:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(554772, 55360, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice NG-style border! However, everything that is not sky seems to have the same tone. The details of the ground seem to attract too much attention away from the bird. Also the bird seems to lack focus. Good effort, however.</td>', 'Nice NG-style border! However, everything that is not sky seems to have the same tone. The details of the ground seem to attract too much attention away from the bird. Also the bird seems to lack focus. Good effort, however.', '2004-01-23 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(554775, 55776, 9550, '<td valign="top">Stunning Photo!!! The hill off center really sets it off for me. The green fading off into the Blue water and Red sky is breath taking! Absolutly Awsome!!!</td>', 'Stunning Photo!!! The hill off center really sets it off for me. The green fading off into the Blue water and Red sky is breath taking! Absolutly Awsome!!!', '2004-01-23 16:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
