(554801, 55777, 11800, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 5 because I like the idea of the photo. I usually vote down a lot when a picture has as much neat image applied to it as this one has. All of the texture and detail was erased and I feel that it is no longer a photograph.</td>', 'I gave you a 5 because I like the idea of the photo. I usually vote down a lot when a picture has as much neat image applied to it as this one has. All of the texture and detail was erased and I feel that it is no longer a photograph.', '2004-01-23 17:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(554822, 54901, 7778, '<td valign="top">A fine image and a worthwhile concern. The wall of cedars (?) in the background is subtle enough, through the fog, to miss. <br/> <br/>Because of this, the diffusion of tones toward the background, I would consider including a little more of  the better defined and more vivid water plants in the very front row, if the composition by thirds tolerated it.<br/> <br/>The misspelled title is an unfortunate slip.</td>', 'A fine image and a worthwhile concern. The wall of cedars (?) in the background is subtle enough, through the fog, to miss.  Because of this, the diffusion of tones toward the background, I would consider including a little more of  the better defined and more vivid water plants in the very front row, if the composition by thirds tolerated it. The misspelled title is an unfortunate slip.', '2004-01-23 17:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(554825, 55640, 10084, '<td valign="top">The vibrant colors of the fish makes this shot almost look 3D. Very sharp details in the coral. Good depth of field helps to fade the coral into the background.</td>', 'The vibrant colors of the fish makes this shot almost look 3D. Very sharp details in the coral. Good depth of field helps to fade the coral into the background.', '2004-01-23 17:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(554827, 55587, 15477, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot. The sharpness of the cat''s facial features along with the bits of meat around it''s mouth and paws really add to the intensity of the shot...good luck!</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot. The sharpness of the cat''s facial features along with the bits of meat around it''s mouth and paws really add to the intensity of the shot...good luck!', '2004-01-23 17:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
