(555128, 55536, 5158, '<td valign="top">I really think that this could be a image in NG: well chosen topic and shows real life. I would have preferred if it had a warmer colour cast. Right now the white are to bright, a little bit into yellow would give the image a more natural look.<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'I really think that this could be a image in NG: well chosen topic and shows real life. I would have preferred if it had a warmer colour cast. Right now the white are to bright, a little bit into yellow would give the image a more natural look.Good luck.', '2004-01-24 05:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(555129, 55738, 5158, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colours and well composed. I think that it is a little to dark and the bright upper left does not look too natural to me.</td>', 'Nice warm colours and well composed. I think that it is a little to dark and the bright upper left does not look too natural to me.', '2004-01-24 05:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(555130, 55706, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great topic! It''s the one that come in everybodies mind frist when thinking about NG.<br/>It''s a little dark though and the expression of the model is too much emptiness.<br/>Still, I do like it very much.</td>', 'Great topic! It''s the one that come in everybodies mind frist when thinking about NG.It''s a little dark though and the expression of the model is too much emptiness.Still, I do like it very much.', '2004-01-24 05:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(555131, 55774, 5158, '<td valign="top">I do like the great smile of the girls eye, I can almost hear her giggle. I don''t see to much "shy" in the image though, more "hide and seek". Also the foreground rose disturbs a lot.</td>', 'I do like the great smile of the girls eye, I can almost hear her giggle. I don''t see to much "shy" in the image though, more "hide and seek". Also the foreground rose disturbs a lot.', '2004-01-24 05:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(555132, 55752, 5158, '<td valign="top">While I like this hairy cow (reminds me a little on our dog :)) to me it is a little too tightly cropped at the top.<br/>Nice colours and well focused though.</td>', 'While I like this hairy cow (reminds me a little on our dog :)) to me it is a little too tightly cropped at the top.Nice colours and well focused though.', '2004-01-24 05:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(555133, 55152, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great earthy colours and nice background too.<br/>I would have placed the Bisson more on the right, so that it is directed into the image rather then outside of it.</td>', 'Great earthy colours and nice background too.I would have placed the Bisson more on the right, so that it is directed into the image rather then outside of it.', '2004-01-24 05:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(555135, 55640, 15690, '<td valign="top">Tricky little fishes.  10</td>', 'Tricky little fishes.  10', '2004-01-24 05:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(555136, 55777, 15690, '<td valign="top">A great cover pic depicting the Sign of the the Times in America.</td>', 'A great cover pic depicting the Sign of the the Times in America.', '2004-01-24 05:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(555141, 55053, 16352, '<td valign="top">These comments may not be appropriate because of camera used. If so, please accept my apologies. It may also be that the original is better than what appears on the monitor.<br/>----<br/>The flash seems to be straight on which in itself need not be a problem but it has burned out the front of the horses face. The coat and mane are beautifully exposed. Unfortunatly the dark  coat of the rider has disembodied his head.<br/>If an off camera flash had been used to the left and pointing up slightly and been held closer to the rider I think it may have illuminated at least the shape of the rider without leaving shadows on the horses face.<br/></td>', 'These comments may not be appropriate because of camera used. If so, please accept my apologies. It may also be that the original is better than what appears on the monitor.----The flash seems to be straight on which in itself need not be a problem but it has burned out the front of the horses face. The coat and mane are beautifully exposed. Unfortunatly the dark  coat of the rider has disembodied his head.If an off camera flash had been used to the left and pointing up slightly and been held closer to the rider I think it may have illuminated at least the shape of the rider without leaving shadows on the horses face.', '2004-01-24 07:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(555142, 55694, 16352, '<td valign="top">Love this. I converted it to black &amp; white and it was even more dramatic.<br/>The trees are so perfect they look like models</td>', 'Love this. I converted it to black & white and it was even more dramatic.The trees are so perfect they look like models', '2004-01-24 07:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(555144, 55683, 16352, '<td valign="top">I like this. I know the "photographic rules" etc say "forground interest" but if you crop the bottom of the picture to get rid of the foregound, that tree looks so lonely and isolated. It pulls it right out of the picture. Also if the camera had gone very slightly further to the left to get the complete shadow of the tree in it would have looked even more isolated. (I accept though that there may be something else there and it could not be done)</td>', 'I like this. I know the "photographic rules" etc say "forground interest" but if you crop the bottom of the picture to get rid of the foregound, that tree looks so lonely and isolated. It pulls it right out of the picture. Also if the camera had gone very slightly further to the left to get the complete shadow of the tree in it would have looked even more isolated. (I accept though that there may be something else there and it could not be done)', '2004-01-24 07:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(555145, 55567, 16352, '<td valign="top">There is a very similar picture to this in the competition except they had lots of the cat in it. Yours has done exactly what I suggested would improve theirs. Get in tight.</td>', 'There is a very similar picture to this in the competition except they had lots of the cat in it. Yours has done exactly what I suggested would improve theirs. Get in tight.', '2004-01-24 07:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(555148, 55587, 16352, '<td valign="top">This is my meat and your not having it. This is one of the nicest pictures of a captive cat I have seen I think (I assume it''s captive). <br/>Only one thing. as the depth of field is not isolating the face, and extends beyond the shoulders, it would have been nice to have got the whole body into focus. Now at the same time I do accept that to get him growling like that while looking almost exactly into the lens does not give time to adjust.  - I would still hang it on my animal wall.<br/></td>', 'This is my meat and your not having it. This is one of the nicest pictures of a captive cat I have seen I think (I assume it''s captive). Only one thing. as the depth of field is not isolating the face, and extends beyond the shoulders, it would have been nice to have got the whole body into focus. Now at the same time I do accept that to get him growling like that while looking almost exactly into the lens does not give time to adjust.  - I would still hang it on my animal wall.', '2004-01-24 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(555156, 55804, 16352, '<td valign="top">I love the texture you have managed to bring out. This could so easily have been "just a lump of stone".<br/>I have 2 points<br/>1: Background colour. Blue detracts from the tool, a very neutral grey may have been even better.<br/>2 The hard shadow, at the bottom of the tool. Maybe a very very soft diffuse light may have softened the shadow. I think it is right to have the shadow, as it gives the tool its shape but the edge is just that tad too hard.</td>', 'I love the texture you have managed to bring out. This could so easily have been "just a lump of stone".I have 2 points1: Background colour. Blue detracts from the tool, a very neutral grey may have been even better.2 The hard shadow, at the bottom of the tool. Maybe a very very soft diffuse light may have softened the shadow. I think it is right to have the shadow, as it gives the tool its shape but the edge is just that tad too hard.', '2004-01-24 08:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(555161, 55541, 16352, '<td valign="top">I can see this being used by "Nat geog" as a cover. Except for the aspect. If it could be shown portrait it would be perfect. Of course I am not sure what "surrounds the picture but if I were you I would get something like the "journal of freelance photographers handbook" (Wherever you are in the world it is still useful) and start submitting it.</td>', 'I can see this being used by "Nat geog" as a cover. Except for the aspect. If it could be shown portrait it would be perfect. Of course I am not sure what "surrounds the picture but if I were you I would get something like the "journal of freelance photographers handbook" (Wherever you are in the world it is still useful) and start submitting it.', '2004-01-24 08:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(555178, 55522, 15109, '<td valign="top">makes me feel cold..  great picture</td>', 'makes me feel cold..  great picture', '2004-01-24 08:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(555179, 55230, 15109, '<td valign="top">national geographic</td>', 'national geographic', '2004-01-24 08:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(555180, 55402, 15109, '<td valign="top">cool!!</td>', 'cool!!', '2004-01-24 08:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(555181, 55797, 15109, '<td valign="top">i never realized cats had eyebrow whiskers - cool pic</td>', 'i never realized cats had eyebrow whiskers - cool pic', '2004-01-24 08:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(555182, 55507, 15109, '<td valign="top">man''s best friend would have been a better title - GREAT PICTURE</td>', 'man''s best friend would have been a better title - GREAT PICTURE', '2004-01-24 08:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(555222, 55790, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice picture here, good soft effect!  I really likt the lighting...  9</td>', 'Nice picture here, good soft effect!  I really likt the lighting...  9', '2004-01-24 09:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(555228, 55790, 6073, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t look real.  Great photograph.  Looking forward to details.</td>', 'This doesn''t look real.  Great photograph.  Looking forward to details.', '2004-01-24 09:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(555229, 55209, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  I think this lighting creates a lot of interest.  Crop is just a little tight for my taste, but it isn''t hurting anything either.  Nice work</td>', 'Excellent photo.  I think this lighting creates a lot of interest.  Crop is just a little tight for my taste, but it isn''t hurting anything either.  Nice work', '2004-01-24 09:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(555230, 55364, 3540, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of JIm Carey in Ace Ventura when he has the asparagus spears in his mouth.  On the other side, it is a good picture.  Well framed and properly exposed.  Good tonal values as well. 7</td>', 'This reminds me of JIm Carey in Ace Ventura when he has the asparagus spears in his mouth.  On the other side, it is a good picture.  Well framed and properly exposed.  Good tonal values as well. 7', '2004-01-24 09:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(555231, 55756, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  I''d have like to seen the lion facing the camera just a little bit more.  Its still an excellent shot.  Great background, sky is a really nice color.  His face has a couple minor hot spots under his nose, but it would be difficult to darken this down without losing the details in the body.  Overall good quality shot 7</td>', 'Excellent capture.  I''d have like to seen the lion facing the camera just a little bit more.  Its still an excellent shot.  Great background, sky is a really nice color.  His face has a couple minor hot spots under his nose, but it would be difficult to darken this down without losing the details in the body.  Overall good quality shot 7', '2004-01-24 10:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(555232, 55757, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I could picture this being in NG.  I like the expression on the monkeys face and the way his eyes are directed.  the focus on his eyes is great and the detail in his fur on his head is very good as well. 9</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I could picture this being in NG.  I like the expression on the monkeys face and the way his eyes are directed.  the focus on his eyes is great and the detail in his fur on his head is very good as well. 9', '2004-01-24 10:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(555235, 55587, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture.  There is a hot spot on the right side of his face, but what can you do?  There seems to be a little bit of fog or steam or something under the left eye, but that could also be from whatever is causing the hotspot.  It almost looks like a lens flare.  But again, what can you do?  A shot like this you have to take if you''re any kind of photographer at all.  Great job to get this one and a very good shot 8</td>', 'This is a great capture.  There is a hot spot on the right side of his face, but what can you do?  There seems to be a little bit of fog or steam or something under the left eye, but that could also be from whatever is causing the hotspot.  It almost looks like a lens flare.  But again, what can you do?  A shot like this you have to take if you''re any kind of photographer at all.  Great job to get this one and a very good shot 8', '2004-01-24 10:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(555240, 55249, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Excellent job with this one.  What an awesome find, to start with.  The picture is extremely well taken too.  There is really good detail, its clear, balanced.  I''m not so sure I prefer the pink hues versus doing something a little warmer though, even if it is ice.  Great work 9</td>', 'Wow.  Excellent job with this one.  What an awesome find, to start with.  The picture is extremely well taken too.  There is really good detail, its clear, balanced.  I''m not so sure I prefer the pink hues versus doing something a little warmer though, even if it is ice.  Great work 9', '2004-01-24 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(555242, 55747, 3540, '<td valign="top">very nice emotive shot.  Excellent capture.  great lighting and framing.  I don''t think I''d do anything to this one but mat it and frame it. 10</td>', 'very nice emotive shot.  Excellent capture.  great lighting and framing.  I don''t think I''d do anything to this one but mat it and frame it. 10', '2004-01-24 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(555246, 55643, 3540, '<td valign="top">The subject is good in this photo.  I think if it were me, I''d have got some more of the trees or more of the reflections.  There seems to be a ton of potential here, if it isn''t cropped to cut something out of the picture.  The trees have some really cool trunks and I can see why you focused on them.  7</td>', 'The subject is good in this photo.  I think if it were me, I''d have got some more of the trees or more of the reflections.  There seems to be a ton of potential here, if it isn''t cropped to cut something out of the picture.  The trees have some really cool trunks and I can see why you focused on them.  7', '2004-01-24 10:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(555248, 55683, 3540, '<td valign="top">sky is messed up.  Noisy, probably oversaturated.  Not that this isn''t a nice picture,  but the sky is a really big distraction.  Even if the horizon is truly tilted, it might not hurt to straighten it.  It would also bring the tree to more of a right angle.</td>', 'sky is messed up.  Noisy, probably oversaturated.  Not that this isn''t a nice picture,  but the sky is a really big distraction.  Even if the horizon is truly tilted, it might not hurt to straighten it.  It would also bring the tree to more of a right angle.', '2004-01-24 10:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(555249, 55640, 3540, '<td valign="top">Intense color.  Great sharp photo.  This is more like cover material. 10</td>', 'Intense color.  Great sharp photo.  This is more like cover material. 10', '2004-01-24 10:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(555250, 55787, 6600, '<td valign="top">Decent exposure and focus, but a bit to centered for my tastes.  I think the composition may have benefited from the rule of thirds being applied.</td>', 'Decent exposure and focus, but a bit to centered for my tastes.  I think the composition may have benefited from the rule of thirds being applied.', '2004-01-24 10:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(555251, 55218, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape.  Trees are just a little bit dark in the foreground.  This is a great photo, and probably a perfect one with a little less sunlight where you could leave the shutter open just a hair longer to get a little more exposure on the dark trees without blowing anything out.  NIce work.  Have to settle for 9 though.</td>', 'Very nice landscape.  Trees are just a little bit dark in the foreground.  This is a great photo, and probably a perfect one with a little less sunlight where you could leave the shutter open just a hair longer to get a little more exposure on the dark trees without blowing anything out.  NIce work.  Have to settle for 9 though.', '2004-01-24 10:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(555253, 55587, 6600, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, decent composition,  but the conspicuouous glare(?) right smack in the middle of the photo is very distracting.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, decent composition,  but the conspicuouous glare(?) right smack in the middle of the photo is very distracting.', '2004-01-24 10:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(555257, 55811, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice photo for the most part, but I think it may be somewhat generic and a little shoehorned into this challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo for the most part, but I think it may be somewhat generic and a little shoehorned into this challenge.', '2004-01-24 10:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(555258, 54901, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice foggy capture, decent composition, nice job.</td>', 'Nice foggy capture, decent composition, nice job.', '2004-01-24 10:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(555262, 55807, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great silhouettes.  Nice exposure and a very ghostly kind of mood.  Not sure if this is a National Geographic type image, but it is a nice image nonetheless 7</td>', 'Great silhouettes.  Nice exposure and a very ghostly kind of mood.  Not sure if this is a National Geographic type image, but it is a nice image nonetheless 7', '2004-01-24 10:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(555263, 55152, 3540, '<td valign="top">Dont like the framing on this.  I think he should''ve been facing the open side, putting him on the opposite side of the frame.   Bison is a little underexposed and the sky is a pretty dreary color too.  Idea for the shot is good, just need to clear up a few details and this would really improve. 6</td>', 'Dont like the framing on this.  I think he should''ve been facing the open side, putting him on the opposite side of the frame.   Bison is a little underexposed and the sky is a pretty dreary color too.  Idea for the shot is good, just need to clear up a few details and this would really improve. 6', '2004-01-24 10:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(555265, 55701, 3540, '<td valign="top">If this were clearer it would be a much more successful shot.  It is very muddy and not clear.  The colors are nice and you don''t have a lot of banding, noise, oversaturated problems that a lot of these shots have.  The picture is just not clear enough.  The colors are beautiful though and I see why you shot this.</td>', 'If this were clearer it would be a much more successful shot.  It is very muddy and not clear.  The colors are nice and you don''t have a lot of banding, noise, oversaturated problems that a lot of these shots have.  The picture is just not clear enough.  The colors are beautiful though and I see why you shot this.', '2004-01-24 10:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(555327, 55242, 5822, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color and I love the detail and detail you''ve captured.  Cropping a bit too tight on top though. Fits the challenge super well...can really see this as a pic in NG. Well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous color and I love the detail and detail you''ve captured.  Cropping a bit too tight on top though. Fits the challenge super well...can really see this as a pic in NG. Well done.', '2004-01-24 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(555334, 55507, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot! very relelvant to these times! 10</td>', 'this is a great shot! very relelvant to these times! 10', '2004-01-24 12:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(555335, 55587, 12268, '<td valign="top">wow! what a capture! Love the ferocity &amp; the intensity! 10</td>', 'wow! what a capture! Love the ferocity & the intensity! 10', '2004-01-24 12:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(555337, 55721, 12268, '<td valign="top">God I hope so! 10</td>', 'God I hope so! 10', '2004-01-24 12:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(555338, 55522, 12268, '<td valign="top">technically this is a great shot. very crisp &amp; beautiful colours! 10</td>', 'technically this is a great shot. very crisp & beautiful colours! 10', '2004-01-24 12:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(555339, 55759, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  LOVE the pastel colors and the subject matter here (my best guess is a horseshoe crab amoungst sea anemones but I''m probably wrong on both accounts).  I think the image could use a bit more contrast and color saturation. Nicely done, though.</td>', 'Great shot!  LOVE the pastel colors and the subject matter here (my best guess is a horseshoe crab amoungst sea anemones but I''m probably wrong on both accounts).  I think the image could use a bit more contrast and color saturation. Nicely done, though.', '2004-01-24 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(555340, 55771, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot! love the angle &amp; composition. the contrast of colours is complimentary. Everything works really well here!. 10</td>', 'this is a great shot! love the angle & composition. the contrast of colours is complimentary. Everything works really well here!. 10', '2004-01-24 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(555342, 55767, 12268, '<td valign="top">very cool shot! 10</td>', 'very cool shot! 10', '2004-01-24 12:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(555343, 55694, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is such a great shot! very moody &amp; almost mystical! Love it. Bumping it up toa 10!</td>', 'this is such a great shot! very moody & almost mystical! Love it. Bumping it up toa 10!', '2004-01-24 12:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(555346, 55777, 5822, '<td valign="top">Subject matter is very compelling. Great human interest story type photograph.  Composition could be somewhat improved with a different angle of view and maybe a narrower DOF. Meets the challenge theme well. Nicely done.</td>', 'Subject matter is very compelling. Great human interest story type photograph.  Composition could be somewhat improved with a different angle of view and maybe a narrower DOF. Meets the challenge theme well. Nicely done.', '2004-01-24 12:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(555349, 55694, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve captured the lighting and the monotone color. Has an eerie mood.</td>', 'I like how you''ve captured the lighting and the monotone color. Has an eerie mood.', '2004-01-24 12:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(555358, 55707, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the flatness of lighting in this image as it really presents these objects (bullets?) as they would be shown in NG.  Even with the flat lighting, your image shows well the texture and detail. Black background is lightly speckled on top. Meets the challenge theme very well.</td>', 'I like the flatness of lighting in this image as it really presents these objects (bullets?) as they would be shown in NG.  Even with the flat lighting, your image shows well the texture and detail. Black background is lightly speckled on top. Meets the challenge theme very well.', '2004-01-24 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(555360, 55402, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter and you''ve captured the detail very well in this macro. I think I would have preferred this in color and with the whites brigher. As it is now, I think it lacks some punch because the whites are so grey looking and flat.  Fits the challenge theme well.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter and you''ve captured the detail very well in this macro. I think I would have preferred this in color and with the whites brigher. As it is now, I think it lacks some punch because the whites are so grey looking and flat.  Fits the challenge theme well.  Good job.', '2004-01-24 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(555363, 55814, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and think the subject matter fits the challenge theme very well. Very interesting angle of view.  I can see this being a picture in NG.  The mask could probably use some more light as it appears too dark and you''ve lost some detail there.  Well done, nonetheless.</td>', 'I love the composition and think the subject matter fits the challenge theme very well. Very interesting angle of view.  I can see this being a picture in NG.  The mask could probably use some more light as it appears too dark and you''ve lost some detail there.  Well done, nonetheless.', '2004-01-24 12:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(555364, 55564, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the profile you''ve captured...very interesting angle of view, but the image appears too dark and the animals head is blending in with the background. Meets the challenge theme well.</td>', 'I like the profile you''ve captured...very interesting angle of view, but the image appears too dark and the animals head is blending in with the background. Meets the challenge theme well.', '2004-01-24 12:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(555421, 55744, 5822, '<td valign="top">Impressive candid photo with so many different facial expressions and gestures of a family portrait. I really love the intensity of the facial expression of the girl in the middle.  Composition is equally impressive and I also love how you fit in to the right upper corner the boy. B&amp;W is perfect for this shot and exposure is excellent.  A classic! Very well done.</td>', 'Impressive candid photo with so many different facial expressions and gestures of a family portrait. I really love the intensity of the facial expression of the girl in the middle.  Composition is equally impressive and I also love how you fit in to the right upper corner the boy. B&W is perfect for this shot and exposure is excellent.  A classic! Very well done.', '2004-01-24 14:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(555424, 55734, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition very nicely done with the swans facing in the same direction. Crop is good too, but I think your exposure is a bit off with the bright sun. Contrast is just a bit too high and water too dark.</td>', 'Composition very nicely done with the swans facing in the same direction. Crop is good too, but I think your exposure is a bit off with the bright sun. Contrast is just a bit too high and water too dark.', '2004-01-24 14:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(555428, 55724, 6597, '<td valign="top">Interesting 7</td>', 'Interesting 7', '2004-01-24 14:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(555429, 55683, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the compoition of this photo the snow and the blue are good 8</td>', 'I like the compoition of this photo the snow and the blue are good 8', '2004-01-24 14:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(555430, 55701, 6597, '<td valign="top">good color</td>', 'good color', '2004-01-24 14:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(555456, 55774, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very cute, I like how her eye is framed by the greenery.  I like you you can see her shy smile in her eye.  The DOF works in the sense it adds to her hiding, but the large blurry rise is distracting.  Would be better without the rose bush at all and just the hedge.  As is, you could crop the right hand side, losing the rose and keeping the green.</td>', 'Very cute, I like how her eye is framed by the greenery.  I like you you can see her shy smile in her eye.  The DOF works in the sense it adds to her hiding, but the large blurry rise is distracting.  Would be better without the rose bush at all and just the hedge.  As is, you could crop the right hand side, losing the rose and keeping the green.', '2004-01-24 15:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(555461, 55585, 7628, '<td valign="top">The building acts as a frame withing the frame - seeing through it to the horizon.  The pale colors do work well with the title, the bard seems to be disappearing.  The details on the side are a bit distracting - the trees on the right and the rusty object inside the barn on the left.  I might crop in on both sides - would make the barn seem even more frail.</td>', 'The building acts as a frame withing the frame - seeing through it to the horizon.  The pale colors do work well with the title, the bard seems to be disappearing.  The details on the side are a bit distracting - the trees on the right and the rusty object inside the barn on the left.  I might crop in on both sides - would make the barn seem even more frail.', '2004-01-24 15:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(555470, 55758, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun colors.  The railings lead the eye up to the painting, the palm trees and blue sky add a nice frame on the left.  Feels a bit tilted to the right.</td>', 'Fun colors.  The railings lead the eye up to the painting, the palm trees and blue sky add a nice frame on the left.  Feels a bit tilted to the right.', '2004-01-24 15:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(555471, 55737, 7628, '<td valign="top">Tiny!  Lovely details on the stripes.  Wish you could have gotten a bit greater DOF.  The dark blue background works well out of focus, but I''d like to see more of the turtle clearly. Also maybe cropped a bit less of the turtle and the finger holding it.</td>', 'Tiny!  Lovely details on the stripes.  Wish you could have gotten a bit greater DOF.  The dark blue background works well out of focus, but I''d like to see more of the turtle clearly. Also maybe cropped a bit less of the turtle and the finger holding it.', '2004-01-24 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(555472, 55560, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the ripples in the water.  Are those raindrops?  The shadow on the left distracts the eye from the lights and colors.  Perhaps if you included more one could tell what it was, or perhaps you cold crop it out all together.  I like the subject and the clever title.</td>', 'I like the ripples in the water.  Are those raindrops?  The shadow on the left distracts the eye from the lights and colors.  Perhaps if you included more one could tell what it was, or perhaps you cold crop it out all together.  I like the subject and the clever title.', '2004-01-24 15:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(555474, 55790, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the glow and soft focus.  Adds to the feeling the title makes you look for.  I wish the tricycle had a completely dark backdrop - the wheel of the cart breaks up the lines.  I like having the old cars on either side.</td>', 'I like the glow and soft focus.  Adds to the feeling the title makes you look for.  I wish the tricycle had a completely dark backdrop - the wheel of the cart breaks up the lines.  I like having the old cars on either side.', '2004-01-24 15:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(555476, 55807, 15975, '<td valign="top">Great photo!!<br/>Where did you take it?<br/>GREAT JOB!!</td>', 'Great photo!!Where did you take it?GREAT JOB!!', '2004-01-24 15:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(555477, 55523, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the blue of the shadows.Perhaps it is the resolution, but it doesn;t seem quite sharp.  As for composition - all that deep blue sky is marvelous, but I''d include more foreground.</td>', 'I like the blue of the shadows.Perhaps it is the resolution, but it doesn;t seem quite sharp.  As for composition - all that deep blue sky is marvelous, but I''d include more foreground.', '2004-01-24 15:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(555479, 55725, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail in the stone.  I like how the white object in the back frames the left side of the face, but I also find it a bit distracting.  Maybe a  crop on the left and bottom to put the white object right in the corner - but then you''d lose the points of the headress.  I don''t know what to suggest.  I like the yellow of the wall and how it brings out the color of the stone.</td>', 'Wonderful detail in the stone.  I like how the white object in the back frames the left side of the face, but I also find it a bit distracting.  Maybe a  crop on the left and bottom to put the white object right in the corner - but then you''d lose the points of the headress.  I don''t know what to suggest.  I like the yellow of the wall and how it brings out the color of the stone.', '2004-01-24 15:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(555480, 55680, 15975, '<td valign="top">Great colour!!<br/>I don''t like the efect of the noise here. Or did you put a low resolution?<br/>Otherwise it is a great photo!<br/></td>', 'Great colour!!I don''t like the efect of the noise here. Or did you put a low resolution?Otherwise it is a great photo!', '2004-01-24 15:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(555481, 55701, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset - fantastic colors and clouds.  I wish we could see some of the river.  Perhaps it is there, I just can;t tell because it is so dark.</td>', 'Lovely sunset - fantastic colors and clouds.  I wish we could see some of the river.  Perhaps it is there, I just can;t tell because it is so dark.', '2004-01-24 15:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(555482, 55418, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting modern version the classic barefoot footsteps of ancestors in fossilized volcanic ash.  Here are the unnatural angles of a shoe and treads.  I like the blue shadows rippling in the sand.</td>', 'An interesting modern version the classic barefoot footsteps of ancestors in fossilized volcanic ash.  Here are the unnatural angles of a shoe and treads.  I like the blue shadows rippling in the sand.', '2004-01-24 15:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(555483, 55804, 7628, '<td valign="top">A nice idea - very NG.  I winder at your choice of blue background.  It is so pale that the stone doesn''t stand out too well.  The light is a bit glaring on the top - perhaps lights from the sides at a low angle would catch more details of this fine point.</td>', 'A nice idea - very NG.  I winder at your choice of blue background.  It is so pale that the stone doesn''t stand out too well.  The light is a bit glaring on the top - perhaps lights from the sides at a low angle would catch more details of this fine point.', '2004-01-24 15:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(555484, 55629, 7628, '<td valign="top">Slice of British life.  Lovely green, lush grass, frames by the trees on either side.  Very orderly and pleasant.  The man with the cane climbs briskly toward the house, his dog give weight to the word "master" in the title.  Wish the composition of man and dog could be more harmonious - the dog doesn;t seem to be heeding too well.</td>', 'Slice of British life.  Lovely green, lush grass, frames by the trees on either side.  Very orderly and pleasant.  The man with the cane climbs briskly toward the house, his dog give weight to the word "master" in the title.  Wish the composition of man and dog could be more harmonious - the dog doesn;t seem to be heeding too well.', '2004-01-24 15:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(555486, 55747, 7628, '<td valign="top">The light glows, and those eyes have such a deep and contented expression! Raises the crumpled grass to almost religious status - I exagerate perhaps but it is very emotive.  Nice composition with the corner of the eye on the thirds line and the arm reaching diagonally to the corner.  The only thing I''d wish is you''d been able to come around to the left a bit more and frame the grass against the darkness. 9</td>', 'The light glows, and those eyes have such a deep and contented expression! Raises the crumpled grass to almost religious status - I exagerate perhaps but it is very emotive.  Nice composition with the corner of the eye on the thirds line and the arm reaching diagonally to the corner.  The only thing I''d wish is you''d been able to come around to the left a bit more and frame the grass against the darkness. 9', '2004-01-24 15:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(555488, 55541, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  I like how we can see the heat of its breath.  Dynamic composition - the diagonal line of the bird. I like how the light catches the top edge of the feathers. Nice undestractiing background, good uase of DOF. Wish it were bigger/ better resolution. 8</td>', 'Great capture!  I like how we can see the heat of its breath.  Dynamic composition - the diagonal line of the bird. I like how the light catches the top edge of the feathers. Nice undestractiing background, good uase of DOF. Wish it were bigger/ better resolution. 8', '2004-01-24 16:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(555491, 55567, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is amazing lighting.  The sweep of the wiskers the glow of the eye.  Simple and marvelous.  I might crop a bit on the left - perhaps just to the left of the middle of the face.  There feels like too much darkness and low detail on the left side of the frame.  This one will be added to my favorites! 9</td>', 'This is amazing lighting.  The sweep of the wiskers the glow of the eye.  Simple and marvelous.  I might crop a bit on the left - perhaps just to the left of the middle of the face.  There feels like too much darkness and low detail on the left side of the frame.  This one will be added to my favorites! 9', '2004-01-24 16:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(555506, 55816, 9906, '<td valign="top">Just an observation...It''s been a long time since I looked through NG but I don''t recall any shots that were at an angle such as this one.  Nice shot overall...<br/>TC</td>', 'Just an observation...It''s been a long time since I looked through NG but I don''t recall any shots that were at an angle such as this one.  Nice shot overall...TC', '2004-01-24 16:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(555507, 55769, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I love the way candidness along with the repitions and simple color scheme!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I love the way candidness along with the repitions and simple color scheme!TC', '2004-01-24 16:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(555508, 55756, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Only thing I would like to see diferent is a little more detail in the shadows.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great shot!  Only thing I would like to see diferent is a little more detail in the shadows.TC', '2004-01-24 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(555509, 55767, 9906, '<td valign="top">There is too much reflection in the windows.  It''s a little distracting...<br/>TC</td>', 'There is too much reflection in the windows.  It''s a little distracting...TC', '2004-01-24 16:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(555510, 55813, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would be much more powerfull as an 8x10 but has too much detail to try and make this small.<br/>TC</td>', 'This would be much more powerfull as an 8x10 but has too much detail to try and make this small.TC', '2004-01-24 16:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(555511, 55574, 8643, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - this did not happen by accident, those eyes are great and the result of much patience - a great photo worthy of National Geographic!</td>', 'Brilliant - this did not happen by accident, those eyes are great and the result of much patience - a great photo worthy of National Geographic!', '2004-01-24 16:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(555512, 55695, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love the repetitions with differences in textures!  Nice composition.  Where is this building?<br/>TC</td>', 'I love the repetitions with differences in textures!  Nice composition.  Where is this building?TC', '2004-01-24 16:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(555513, 55788, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard that the most expensive part of photography was the travel...(wink)  Just kidding, can''t wait to see what this really is.  I think it''s snow...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ve heard that the most expensive part of photography was the travel...(wink)  Just kidding, can''t wait to see what this really is.  I think it''s snow...TC', '2004-01-24 16:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(555515, 55483, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and textures.  I gotta find a market like this.<br/>TC</td>', 'Beautiful colors and textures.  I gotta find a market like this.TC', '2004-01-24 17:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(555517, 55370, 12475, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I love photos like this that make something special out of the ordinary. The border''s a little distracting.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I love photos like this that make something special out of the ordinary. The border''s a little distracting.', '2004-01-24 17:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(555518, 55420, 12475, '<td valign="top">Positively stunning; fantastic detail.</td>', 'Positively stunning; fantastic detail.', '2004-01-24 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
