(555520, 55771, 12475, '<td valign="top">Wow! The colors are perfect, composition is excellent; this is one of my favorite shots in the challenge (and ever)! A 10 from me.</td>', 'Wow! The colors are perfect, composition is excellent; this is one of my favorite shots in the challenge (and ever)! A 10 from me.', '2004-01-24 17:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(555521, 55815, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, original, creative--great colors, beautifully balanced composition.</td>', 'This is lovely, original, creative--great colors, beautifully balanced composition.', '2004-01-24 17:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(555522, 55541, 12475, '<td valign="top">An astonishing capture! Gorgeous.</td>', 'An astonishing capture! Gorgeous.', '2004-01-24 17:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(555523, 55114, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your horizon appears to be not level.  I would also prefer to see all the animal or less of him with a more interesting composition!<br/>TC</td>', 'Your horizon appears to be not level.  I would also prefer to see all the animal or less of him with a more interesting composition!TC', '2004-01-24 17:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(555524, 55359, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO this looks over sharpened and perhaps a touch over saturated.<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO this looks over sharpened and perhaps a touch over saturated.TC', '2004-01-24 17:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(555525, 55807, 12475, '<td valign="top">I love the gothic, moody, painterly quality of this photo.</td>', 'I love the gothic, moody, painterly quality of this photo.', '2004-01-24 17:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(555529, 55820, 9906, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this looks a little dull and gives the shot a two dimensional feeling.  I don''t know where this is but if you were allowed to bring in more lighting from the sides it would help!<br/>TC</td>', 'The lighting on this looks a little dull and gives the shot a two dimensional feeling.  I don''t know where this is but if you were allowed to bring in more lighting from the sides it would help!TC', '2004-01-24 17:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(555531, 55752, 9906, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S a fur coat!  Just kidding, the focus here seems just a touch soft for my tast and this type of subject.  I would rather see it sharper.  Nice colors!<br/>TC</td>', 'Now THAT''S a fur coat!  Just kidding, the focus here seems just a touch soft for my tast and this type of subject.  I would rather see it sharper.  Nice colors!TC', '2004-01-24 17:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(555533, 55685, 9906, '<td valign="top">The greenary side of the building is a little underexposed while part of the building at the top is a tad over exposed.  This leads me to believe the lighting was a little harsh.  At a different time of day this may come out better!  You also have some perspective issues that a slightly different angle or not so tight crop may help to over come.  Nice building.  Where is it?<br/>TC</td>', 'The greenary side of the building is a little underexposed while part of the building at the top is a tad over exposed.  This leads me to believe the lighting was a little harsh.  At a different time of day this may come out better!  You also have some perspective issues that a slightly different angle or not so tight crop may help to over come.  Nice building.  Where is it?TC', '2004-01-24 17:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(555534, 55803, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very hard shot to get the exposure just right.  Your snow is a touch overexposed losing the detail.  The evergreens however are exposed almost perfectly!  Your composition is a touch busy.  A slightly lower angle might help with that.  I personally don''t like the Polaroid (tm) feeling of the border...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very hard shot to get the exposure just right.  Your snow is a touch overexposed losing the detail.  The evergreens however are exposed almost perfectly!  Your composition is a touch busy.  A slightly lower angle might help with that.  I personally don''t like the Polaroid (tm) feeling of the border...TC', '2004-01-24 17:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(555535, 55807, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice tones!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice tones!TC', '2004-01-24 17:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(555542, 55242, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the way you''ve cut off the top of his neck.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the way you''ve cut off the top of his neck.', '2004-01-24 17:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(555550, 55522, 8889, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, congratulations!</td>', 'Beautiful photo, congratulations!', '2004-01-24 17:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(555563, 55752, 2158, '<td valign="top">That tag on his ear disturbs me a bit, especially if this photo is intended for NG.  Cropping wouldn''t work well here but you might try cloning it out.</td>', 'That tag on his ear disturbs me a bit, especially if this photo is intended for NG.  Cropping wouldn''t work well here but you might try cloning it out.', '2004-01-24 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(555587, 55747, 6097, '<td valign="top">WOW!  What a great shot.  I really like the light here.  I''m assuming it is natural sunlight?  Nice shadow detail.  I love the expression and how the primate is examining the weeds.  Good luck!!!  I think this will be in the top 5 if not in the top 3.</td>', 'WOW!  What a great shot.  I really like the light here.  I''m assuming it is natural sunlight?  Nice shadow detail.  I love the expression and how the primate is examining the weeds.  Good luck!!!  I think this will be in the top 5 if not in the top 3.', '2004-01-24 18:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(555589, 55053, 11508, '<td valign="top">rugly?  Nice photo, did you use a flash?, perhaps it would have benefited from no flash, but I know that shooting horses is hard cause you need a short exposure.</td>', 'rugly?  Nice photo, did you use a flash?, perhaps it would have benefited from no flash, but I know that shooting horses is hard cause you need a short exposure.', '2004-01-24 18:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(555634, 55781, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting is really great and I like the contrast and different shades of blue and white.  Only thing I think it really needs is one interesting subject to bring the whole composition together, like maybe a gull sitting on a block of wood. Good job.</td>', 'Lighting is really great and I like the contrast and different shades of blue and white.  Only thing I think it really needs is one interesting subject to bring the whole composition together, like maybe a gull sitting on a block of wood. Good job.', '2004-01-24 20:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
