(555723, 55790, 5822, '<td valign="top">You''ve really captured a period so well with this image. This picture has nostalgia and reminiscense written all over it.  It''s not just the vintage vehicles but the lighting as well that lend it that quality.  Has a dream-like quality and I also like the arrangement of elements in the frame.</td>', 'You''ve really captured a period so well with this image. This picture has nostalgia and reminiscense written all over it.  It''s not just the vintage vehicles but the lighting as well that lend it that quality.  Has a dream-like quality and I also like the arrangement of elements in the frame.', '2004-01-24 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(555729, 55483, 16533, '<td valign="top">great composition, full of interest, good angle too. Super photo!</td>', 'great composition, full of interest, good angle too. Super photo!', '2004-01-24 23:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
