(555756, 54901, 5822, '<td valign="top">Absolutely LOVE this painterly photograph!!!  Even without a definite subject it''s great.  Very romantic and dreamlike. The pastel and muted colors are wonderful and the light is equisite! I can''t say enough about how I feel about it...maybe my all time favorite on DPC.</td>', 'Absolutely LOVE this painterly photograph!!!  Even without a definite subject it''s great.  Very romantic and dreamlike. The pastel and muted colors are wonderful and the light is equisite! I can''t say enough about how I feel about it...maybe my all time favorite on DPC.', '2004-01-25 00:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
