(555877, 55501, 16046, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, noteworthy.</td>', 'Very sharp, noteworthy.', '2004-01-25 01:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(555878, 55790, 16046, '<td valign="top">Cool 3d look, can you explain how you did this?</td>', 'Cool 3d look, can you explain how you did this?', '2004-01-25 01:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(555880, 55499, 9906, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like big borders, but this time it seems to center the shot.  I think it needs a touch more exposure in the foreground to pick out just a touch more detail.  Nice job overall.<br/>TC</td>', 'I normally don''t like big borders, but this time it seems to center the shot.  I think it needs a touch more exposure in the foreground to pick out just a touch more detail.  Nice job overall.TC', '2004-01-25 02:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(555882, 55507, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looking at the guys hands, you can tell that the dog was stiller than the human.  Interesting capture!  Hope to hear the story behind it!<br/>TC</td>', 'Looking at the guys hands, you can tell that the dog was stiller than the human.  Interesting capture!  Hope to hear the story behind it!TC', '2004-01-25 02:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(555883, 55804, 9906, '<td valign="top">This appears to be taken with an on camera flash.  You''ll get much better results with bright lights and a tripod with no flash...<br/>TC</td>', 'This appears to be taken with an on camera flash.  You''ll get much better results with bright lights and a tripod with no flash...TC', '2004-01-25 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(555886, 55643, 9906, '<td valign="top">The border is shouting at me and I can\''t hear the whisper of the cypress\''...</td>', 'The border is shouting at me and I can\''t hear the whisper of the cypress\''...', '2004-01-25 02:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(555887, 55640, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice clear aquatic shot!  Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice clear aquatic shot!  KudosTC', '2004-01-25 02:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(555888, 55629, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully composed!  Shows action in it''s simplest form!  Just a touch more detail in the dog and it''s perfect...  Can''t wait to see who and where!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very beautifully composed!  Shows action in it''s simplest form!  Just a touch more detail in the dog and it''s perfect...  Can''t wait to see who and where!TC', '2004-01-25 02:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(555889, 55564, 9906, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit dark and the focus seems just a spot off...<br/>TC</td>', 'It''s a bit dark and the focus seems just a spot off...TC', '2004-01-25 02:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(555890, 55567, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome angle!  A smidge more detail (DOF) and a touch of fill light and this would be perfect!<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome angle!  A smidge more detail (DOF) and a touch of fill light and this would be perfect!TC', '2004-01-25 02:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(555896, 55574, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry if I''m wrong, but the DOF looks photoshoped in here...A zoo?  Just wonderin''...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry if I''m wrong, but the DOF looks photoshoped in here...A zoo?  Just wonderin''...TC', '2004-01-25 02:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(555899, 55669, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...And this one doesn''t look like it''s in the wild...  Sorry just an observation about the title.<br/>TC</td>', 'Hmmm...And this one doesn''t look like it''s in the wild...  Sorry just an observation about the title.TC', '2004-01-25 02:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(555902, 55585, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  You got the article summed up in one picture!  Nice clear simple and to the point!  No unneeded elements!  Great composition.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice!  You got the article summed up in one picture!  Nice clear simple and to the point!  No unneeded elements!  Great composition.TC', '2004-01-25 02:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(555906, 55765, 9906, '<td valign="top">The DOF here looks to me like it''s not quite natural and maybe PS''d in.  (sorry if I''m wrong...)<br/>TC</td>', 'The DOF here looks to me like it''s not quite natural and maybe PS''d in.  (sorry if I''m wrong...)TC', '2004-01-25 02:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(555913, 55724, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but my eye is irrevocably draw to the sharply foucused tree to the right of center.  All the lines seem to point at it or parallel it.   Is this where you wanted me to look?  Very interesting!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice composition, but my eye is irrevocably draw to the sharply foucused tree to the right of center.  All the lines seem to point at it or parallel it.   Is this where you wanted me to look?  Very interesting!TC', '2004-01-25 02:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(555917, 55776, 9906, '<td valign="top">This seems to be a touch under exposed.  This alone wouldn''t be so bad, but the orange border, being brighter, seems to make it worse.  Would love to see this sans border and with more exposed!  Is a reshoot possible?<br/>TC</td>', 'This seems to be a touch under exposed.  This alone wouldn''t be so bad, but the orange border, being brighter, seems to make it worse.  Would love to see this sans border and with more exposed!  Is a reshoot possible?TC', '2004-01-25 02:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(555919, 55563, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome architectural shot!  What home is this?<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome architectural shot!  What home is this?TC', '2004-01-25 02:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(555991, 55551, 16352, '<td valign="top">I personally found the tilt disruptive and did nothing for the image. Would also have liked to have seen you move slightly to the right to get rid of what appears to be a broken concrete litter bin. I think the condition of the pole, pavement and seller would still have looked stark against the modern car/buildings roadway. I think about 1.5 shots extra exposure would have helped pull some facial detail out.</td>', 'I personally found the tilt disruptive and did nothing for the image. Would also have liked to have seen you move slightly to the right to get rid of what appears to be a broken concrete litter bin. I think the condition of the pole, pavement and seller would still have looked stark against the modern car/buildings roadway. I think about 1.5 shots extra exposure would have helped pull some facial detail out.', '2004-01-25 06:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(555992, 55715, 16352, '<td valign="top">Very good eye contact &amp; love the cats brush looking coat but I find the label on the left totally disruptive and the blank area above the cat  unnecessary. I cropped just above the cats ears and halfwaway along his coat so it totally filled the frame and it really brought the expression out.</td>', 'Very good eye contact & love the cats brush looking coat but I find the label on the left totally disruptive and the blank area above the cat  unnecessary. I cropped just above the cats ears and halfwaway along his coat so it totally filled the frame and it really brought the expression out.', '2004-01-25 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(555993, 55734, 16352, '<td valign="top">Always difficult to get the exposure right on swans on a sunny day. and this is almost perfect.  Try cropping the blank space so that the heads of the swans are at the edge of the picture.  It seems to elongate the swans necks and make them even more impressive</td>', 'Always difficult to get the exposure right on swans on a sunny day. and this is almost perfect.  Try cropping the blank space so that the heads of the swans are at the edge of the picture.  It seems to elongate the swans necks and make them even more impressive', '2004-01-25 06:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(555997, 55563, 16352, '<td valign="top">So hard to get exposures right on this sort of shot but it has been done here. Still retaining detail in the shadows of the balconies.  That patch on the left bothers me though. Hold a piece of card along the left to crop that out and it seems to tighten everything up without losing the essence of the picture.</td>', 'So hard to get exposures right on this sort of shot but it has been done here. Still retaining detail in the shadows of the balconies.  That patch on the left bothers me though. Hold a piece of card along the left to crop that out and it seems to tighten everything up without losing the essence of the picture.', '2004-01-25 06:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(555998, 55360, 16352, '<td valign="top">Nice picture (not sure what the bird is). Unsure if this was a grabbed or planned shot. If it was planned, if you could have got the camera a little closer to the ground, not so much of it would have been lost in the mud/grass or going to the other exteme - moving higher to show how well camoflaged it is!.</td>', 'Nice picture (not sure what the bird is). Unsure if this was a grabbed or planned shot. If it was planned, if you could have got the camera a little closer to the ground, not so much of it would have been lost in the mud/grass or going to the other exteme - moving higher to show how well camoflaged it is!.', '2004-01-25 06:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(555999, 55809, 16352, '<td valign="top">If the aperture could have been a bit smaller and the depth of field extended to bring just that bit more of the fungi into focus this would have been great. A couple more stops exposure would (I think have brought out that little more detail in the dark area and plant above it. Really nice composition</td>', 'If the aperture could have been a bit smaller and the depth of field extended to bring just that bit more of the fungi into focus this would have been great. A couple more stops exposure would (I think have brought out that little more detail in the dark area and plant above it. Really nice composition', '2004-01-25 06:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(556001, 55499, 16352, '<td valign="top">I see what you were trying to do but try this.<br/>Crop out the whole of the stump on the left hand side. The middle stump, left stump and river then draw the eye straight to the setting sun. I think it makes a dramatic shot even more dramatic. If I had seen it presented like that I think it would be a fefinate 8 poss 9</td>', 'I see what you were trying to do but try this.Crop out the whole of the stump on the left hand side. The middle stump, left stump and river then draw the eye straight to the setting sun. I think it makes a dramatic shot even more dramatic. If I had seen it presented like that I think it would be a fefinate 8 poss 9', '2004-01-25 06:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(556023, 55725, 16352, '<td valign="top">The exposure keeps the detail perfectly but I keep finding the wall artifact distracting. I keep trying to make out exactly what it is. It''s a shame because the background colour enhances everything about the colour of the bust. I dont know if it would have been possible to change the angle of view - possibly not. Otherwise I love it.</td>', 'The exposure keeps the detail perfectly but I keep finding the wall artifact distracting. I keep trying to make out exactly what it is. It''s a shame because the background colour enhances everything about the colour of the bust. I dont know if it would have been possible to change the angle of view - possibly not. Otherwise I love it.', '2004-01-25 07:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(556024, 55777, 16352, '<td valign="top">Love this shote - beautiful colours - Try cropping much tighter around the dog and friend and I think it gives it much more impact  and gets rid of the traffic light control growing out of his head</td>', 'Love this shote - beautiful colours - Try cropping much tighter around the dog and friend and I think it gives it much more impact  and gets rid of the traffic light control growing out of his head', '2004-01-25 07:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(556027, 55716, 16352, '<td valign="top">I like this better with a much tighter crop on the woman. I just find the man distracting. Using the rule of thirds though has paid off though as if the man has to be there he is almost drawing the eye to the female. Well exposed. If you had gone (may not have been possible I know) to have gone to the left slightly it may have been possible to have hidden him behind her and she would have filled the frame - and that would have still retained her obvious concentration - at the same time hiding some of the fence which is a little intrusive.</td>', 'I like this better with a much tighter crop on the woman. I just find the man distracting. Using the rule of thirds though has paid off though as if the man has to be there he is almost drawing the eye to the female. Well exposed. If you had gone (may not have been possible I know) to have gone to the left slightly it may have been possible to have hidden him behind her and she would have filled the frame - and that would have still retained her obvious concentration - at the same time hiding some of the fence which is a little intrusive.', '2004-01-25 07:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(556029, 55717, 16352, '<td valign="top">beautiful lighting - Was it natural. Some would say the back and wing is too dark but I really think this works. Cropping out the left and top space leaving his head in the top left corner, I think, really brings the lighting effect to the fore even more.</td>', 'beautiful lighting - Was it natural. Some would say the back and wing is too dark but I really think this works. Cropping out the left and top space leaving his head in the top left corner, I think, really brings the lighting effect to the fore even more.', '2004-01-25 08:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(556062, 55737, 9906, '<td valign="top">When we got my kid''s turtle ''Seven'' (See Macro III challenge) he was about that size.  Now he''s WAY bigger!  I would have liked to see more turtle and less finger though.<br/>TC</td>', 'When we got my kid''s turtle ''Seven'' (See Macro III challenge) he was about that size.  Now he''s WAY bigger!  I would have liked to see more turtle and less finger though.TC', '2004-01-25 09:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(556064, 55718, 9906, '<td valign="top">Needs some more creative lighting.  This looks very flat...<br/>TC</td>', 'Needs some more creative lighting.  This looks very flat...TC', '2004-01-25 09:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(556066, 55471, 9906, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this full size.  At this size it looses much of it''s impact...<br/>TC</td>', 'I would love to see this full size.  At this size it looses much of it''s impact...TC', '2004-01-25 09:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(556070, 55757, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your border shouts and drowns out the call of the wild...<br/>TC</td>', 'Your border shouts and drowns out the call of the wild...TC', '2004-01-25 09:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(556071, 55809, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your focus seems a smidge off from where your title tells me to look...<br/>TC</td>', 'Your focus seems a smidge off from where your title tells me to look...TC', '2004-01-25 09:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(556072, 55053, 9906, '<td valign="top">Needs just a touch more light.  You can not tell where rider ends and night starts...<br/>TC</td>', 'Needs just a touch more light.  You can not tell where rider ends and night starts...TC', '2004-01-25 09:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(556074, 55725, 9906, '<td valign="top">Finally a sculpture (artifact) with a touch of interesting light and angle...<br/>TC</td>', 'Finally a sculpture (artifact) with a touch of interesting light and angle...TC', '2004-01-25 09:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(556077, 55771, 9906, '<td valign="top">A touch more creative lighting would help pull out the textures more.<br/>TC</td>', 'A touch more creative lighting would help pull out the textures more.TC', '2004-01-25 09:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(556083, 55541, 9906, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like smaller images like this one, but this time it seems to accentuate!<br/>TC</td>', 'I normally don''t like smaller images like this one, but this time it seems to accentuate!TC', '2004-01-25 09:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(556086, 55399, 9906, '<td valign="top">A big cat shot that doesn''t look like it''s in an artificial evnironment.  Nice capture!<br/>TC</td>', 'A big cat shot that doesn''t look like it''s in an artificial evnironment.  Nice capture!TC', '2004-01-25 09:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(556127, 55585, 3082, '<td valign="top">Nice Photo Next time widen your angle to include the whole subject thou</td>', 'Nice Photo Next time widen your angle to include the whole subject thou', '2004-01-25 10:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(556130, 55640, 13390, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF. I love the colors!</td>', 'Excellent DOF. I love the colors!', '2004-01-25 10:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(556147, 55694, 2223, '<td valign="top">Wow, just beautiful!!! 10</td>', 'Wow, just beautiful!!! 10', '2004-01-25 10:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(556158, 55707, 2223, '<td valign="top">I''m really curious about how you found these, did you use a metal detector? The reason i''m asking is because my husband is into finding things in the ground with his metal detector, mostly coins and old things. He wants to take a trip to Gettysburgh someday. These old bullets are very interesting.</td>', 'I''m really curious about how you found these, did you use a metal detector? The reason i''m asking is because my husband is into finding things in the ground with his metal detector, mostly coins and old things. He wants to take a trip to Gettysburgh someday. These old bullets are very interesting.', '2004-01-25 11:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(556161, 55807, 16352, '<td valign="top">Entered quite a long comment on this one but for some reason it did not save. Anyway it was the only one I gave 10 to. Everything about this has worked. Even the fact that some people would grumble about the burned out sun. In this case I believe it has totally worked. It must surely win. For some reason I am also unable to add to favourites with this one. Could you email me so I can keep an eye on your work and see older work.<br/>Thanks<br/></td>', 'Entered quite a long comment on this one but for some reason it did not save. Anyway it was the only one I gave 10 to. Everything about this has worked. Even the fact that some people would grumble about the burned out sun. In this case I believe it has totally worked. It must surely win. For some reason I am also unable to add to favourites with this one. Could you email me so I can keep an eye on your work and see older work.Thanks', '2004-01-25 11:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(556189, 55242, 9504, '<td valign="top">gorgeous photo...if a little red.  Did you adjust the contrast?</td>', 'gorgeous photo...if a little red.  Did you adjust the contrast?', '2004-01-25 12:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(556197, 55807, 7628, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  This is one to put on the wall and admire.  I''d never get tired of looking at that!  Dramatic lighting and composition of the light, the "gesture" of the trees, the texture of the clouds.  10</td>', 'Gorgeous!  This is one to put on the wall and admire.  I''d never get tired of looking at that!  Dramatic lighting and composition of the light, the "gesture" of the trees, the texture of the clouds.  10', '2004-01-25 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(556198, 55819, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF, makes a great background.  Balances composition - those are great ears, like the hairs bristling off the neck.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF, makes a great background.  Balances composition - those are great ears, like the hairs bristling off the neck.', '2004-01-25 12:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(556199, 55420, 7628, '<td valign="top">What a look indeed. The DOF works well to distinguish the subject from the background  even though they are the same color.  I might crop the top and make it a more square composition.</td>', 'What a look indeed. The DOF works well to distinguish the subject from the background  even though they are the same color.  I might crop the top and make it a more square composition.', '2004-01-25 12:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(556201, 55707, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and even lighting.  Dark background really helps the eye concentrate on the bullets.  Having two - set in this composition creats a good balance.</td>', 'Nice detail and even lighting.  Dark background really helps the eye concentrate on the bullets.  Having two - set in this composition creats a good balance.', '2004-01-25 12:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(556237, 55316, 6597, '<td valign="top">good texture and reflection</td>', 'good texture and reflection', '2004-01-25 13:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(556238, 55581, 6597, '<td valign="top">good color</td>', 'good color', '2004-01-25 13:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(556242, 55363, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like fog effect</td>', 'I like fog effect', '2004-01-25 13:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(556280, 55483, 10402, '<td valign="top">The boy has a great pose and the produce gives a sense of place, which is important for National Geographic images.</td>', 'The boy has a great pose and the produce gives a sense of place, which is important for National Geographic images.', '2004-01-25 13:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(556281, 55471, 10402, '<td valign="top">This would make a great fold-out cover photo for an article on Chicago. It nicely captures the shapes and colors of this unique city. There are just enough reflections to identify the foreground as water without distracting from the city itself.</td>', 'This would make a great fold-out cover photo for an article on Chicago. It nicely captures the shapes and colors of this unique city. There are just enough reflections to identify the foreground as water without distracting from the city itself.', '2004-01-25 14:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(556283, 55507, 10402, '<td valign="top">An image only a camera could capture; most people would focus on the crowd and look higher to see their heads. The time exposure makes the crowd translucent and denying visibility of the heads makes the viewer focus on the "forgotten person". This needs to be in black and white to emphasize its starkness, and I hope that even the National Geographic editors would agree with that choice even though they normally favor color.</td>', 'An image only a camera could capture; most people would focus on the crowd and look higher to see their heads. The time exposure makes the crowd translucent and denying visibility of the heads makes the viewer focus on the "forgotten person". This needs to be in black and white to emphasize its starkness, and I hope that even the National Geographic editors would agree with that choice even though they normally favor color.', '2004-01-25 14:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(556284, 55522, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo.  Great colors, great sence of both speed (wind) and climate.  10</td>', 'Fantastic photo.  Great colors, great sence of both speed (wind) and climate.  10', '2004-01-25 14:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(556285, 55771, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Perfect angle, cropping and position.  Oh and nice background...really brings out the colors.  Nice one !</td>', 'Great shot.  Perfect angle, cropping and position.  Oh and nice background...really brings out the colors.  Nice one !', '2004-01-25 14:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(556289, 55809, 10084, '<td valign="top">The composition and the elements you have gives it a deep jungle exotic feeling. I get the feeling of the humid air that you find there. The nice half circle of the fungus gives it a cool abstract shape . The vibrant colors of the subject is very nice. The green color of the moss around the subject really helps to make it pop out of the shot.</td>', 'The composition and the elements you have gives it a deep jungle exotic feeling. I get the feeling of the humid air that you find there. The nice half circle of the fungus gives it a cool abstract shape . The vibrant colors of the subject is very nice. The green color of the moss around the subject really helps to make it pop out of the shot.', '2004-01-25 14:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(556290, 55816, 10084, '<td valign="top">The reeds definitely gives this an interesting composition. The blue hues in the water really is a good background to make the reeds pop out. I think a straight shot would be better then this extreme angled one. It makes you turn your head to straighten it and then you want to move on.</td>', 'The reeds definitely gives this an interesting composition. The blue hues in the water really is a good background to make the reeds pop out. I think a straight shot would be better then this extreme angled one. It makes you turn your head to straighten it and then you want to move on.', '2004-01-25 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(556291, 55507, 10818, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo.  Really gives the feeling of the world passing him by.  Great one.</td>', 'Fantastic photo.  Really gives the feeling of the world passing him by.  Great one.', '2004-01-25 14:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(556295, 55737, 10818, '<td valign="top">Finger  and fingernail are very distracting.<br/>Even with that picture, it could have been chopped out.  It has a nice background.  And its a good photo.</td>', 'Finger  and fingernail are very distracting.Even with that picture, it could have been chopped out.  It has a nice background.  And its a good photo.', '2004-01-25 14:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(556297, 55249, 10084, '<td valign="top">Boosting the contrast would really add more impact to the shot. The composition is wonderful and interesting. White balance seems to be off and the ice looks pinkish.</td>', 'Boosting the contrast would really add more impact to the shot. The composition is wonderful and interesting. White balance seems to be off and the ice looks pinkish.', '2004-01-25 14:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(556299, 55614, 10084, '<td valign="top">Gives the feeling of a great NG picture. This gives the feeling of a place that not many have gone and explored. Composition is really good in that the slopping landscape makes your eyes follow down the hill. The misty background almost gives you goosebumps feeling how cold it is.</td>', 'Gives the feeling of a great NG picture. This gives the feeling of a place that not many have gone and explored. Composition is really good in that the slopping landscape makes your eyes follow down the hill. The misty background almost gives you goosebumps feeling how cold it is.', '2004-01-25 14:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(556307, 55605, 10084, '<td valign="top">Bumping up the contrast should help the shot from looking flat. The color are muted and doesn''t have the impact it deserves.  The composition is interesting with the nice shadow.</td>', 'Bumping up the contrast should help the shot from looking flat. The color are muted and doesn''t have the impact it deserves.  The composition is interesting with the nice shadow.', '2004-01-25 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(556310, 55643, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is interesting with the diagonal lineup of the tree trunks. Reflections in the water are wonderful.</td>', 'Composition is interesting with the diagonal lineup of the tree trunks. Reflections in the water are wonderful.', '2004-01-25 14:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(556311, 55782, 10084, '<td valign="top">That is one thick tree trunk. Beautiful green hues in the leaves gives it a 3D look. Contrast is very good.</td>', 'That is one thick tree trunk. Beautiful green hues in the leaves gives it a 3D look. Contrast is very good.', '2004-01-25 14:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(556332, 55807, 16262, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photo - Great Mood shot</td>', 'Excellent Photo - Great Mood shot', '2004-01-25 15:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(556361, 55747, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is an unbelievable picture.<br/>Remarkable pose. This is in my top three pictures for what I feel is a stiff competition. These are some of the best images Ive seen on DPC. You should be proud of this. 10<br/></td>', 'This is an unbelievable picture.Remarkable pose. This is in my top three pictures for what I feel is a stiff competition. These are some of the best images Ive seen on DPC. You should be proud of this. 10', '2004-01-25 16:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
