(556595, 55316, 16381, '<td valign="top">Best of show.Good composition and excellent tonal range couple with perfect timing make this a thought provoking image.</td>', 'Best of show.Good composition and excellent tonal range couple with perfect timing make this a thought provoking image.', '2004-01-25 21:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
