(557192, 55815, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I was sure I commented on this while the challenge was running... evidently not!<br/>I think this is a beautiful image - the sharp crystals against the soft globes of frozen dew and the silver against the terracotta background work very well for me.<br/>Lovely!</td>', 'Sorry, I was sure I commented on this while the challenge was running... evidently not!I think this is a beautiful image - the sharp crystals against the soft globes of frozen dew and the silver against the terracotta background work very well for me.Lovely!', '2004-01-26 03:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
