(557444, 55695, 16529, '<td valign="top">Great example of architecture! Overall this photo is great. The repetition of column textures. The texture of the snow! Overall texture. <br/> <br/>The lighting of this photo is a little dull. Your perspective is great. The slant of the photo gives the eye somewhere to move. Movement is great in a still life photo! If I were the editor of National Geographic your picture would definately go in this issue! Great Job.<br/> <br/>geschlechtmann27 <br/>Critique Club</td>', 'Great example of architecture! Overall this photo is great. The repetition of column textures. The texture of the snow! Overall texture.  The lighting of this photo is a little dull. Your perspective is great. The slant of the photo gives the eye somewhere to move. Movement is great in a still life photo! If I were the editor of National Geographic your picture would definately go in this issue! Great Job. geschlechtmann27 Critique Club', '2004-01-26 08:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
