(557608, 55536, 2752, '<td valign="top">A big thankyou for all the comments.  Annie lives alone without running water and very few ammenities.   Grinds coffee beans in the coffee grinder seen on the wall,melts snow for water in the winter and collects dew and rain water in barrels the rest of the year.  The cabin is very small and she has fixed it up over the years.  She is always happy to have visiters. She is originally from Holland.</td>', 'A big thankyou for all the comments.  Annie lives alone without running water and very few ammenities.   Grinds coffee beans in the coffee grinder seen on the wall,melts snow for water in the winter and collects dew and rain water in barrels the rest of the year.  The cabin is very small and she has fixed it up over the years.  She is always happy to have visiters. She is originally from Holland.', '2004-01-26 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 0),
