(559023, 55738, 3747, '<td valign="top">Why two people have said the bright spot is on the top left, I don''t know? But I must say that the bright spot looks like it was added after the picture was taken. Whether it was or not, it is a little distracting. A more even light distrobution would be preferred. Good shot.</td>', 'Why two people have said the bright spot is on the top left, I don''t know? But I must say that the bright spot looks like it was added after the picture was taken. Whether it was or not, it is a little distracting. A more even light distrobution would be preferred. Good shot.', '2004-01-27 13:32:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(559123, 55694, 14509, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on being placed in the top 10th, especially with such a hard category to compete with. I rather like the under exposure of this shot. It gives it a moody feeling, and it has captured the sky colours with a dramatic feeling. I wouldn''t change a thing. Very well seen.</td>', 'Congratulations on being placed in the top 10th, especially with such a hard category to compete with. I rather like the under exposure of this shot. It gives it a moody feeling, and it has captured the sky colours with a dramatic feeling. I wouldn''t change a thing. Very well seen.', '2004-01-27 15:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
