(750240, 55744, 7322, '<td valign="top">Of course you had to crop their heads otherwise you wouldn''t have captured the older girl''s protective grasp of her sister''s hand or the defiant hand on hip pose (implied by the position of her head and shoulder) of the younger girl. Lovely! I want to see more like this on DPC.</td>', 'Of course you had to crop their heads otherwise you wouldn''t have captured the older girl''s protective grasp of her sister''s hand or the defiant hand on hip pose (implied by the position of her head and shoulder) of the younger girl. Lovely! I want to see more like this on DPC.', '2004-06-04 12:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
